{"id": "7th-t1-u1-103", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "match", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "7", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "1", "unit_id": "ta-u1-amudhat-tamil", "lesson_id": "ta-l5-kutriyalugaram", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "maathirai-metrics-match", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "எழுத்துகளின் வகைகளையும் அவற்றுக்குரிய இயல்பான மாத்திரை அளவுகளையும் பொருத்துக:\nபட்டியல் I (எழுத்து வகை):\nL1. குற்றியலுகரம்\nL2. தனி நெடில் உயிர்மெய் எழுத்து\nL3. முற்றியலுகரம் (தனிக்குறிலை அடுத்து வரும் உகரம்)\nL4. குற்றியலிகரம்\nபட்டியல் II (மாத்திரை அளவு):\nR1. 1 மாத்திரை\nR2. 1/2 மாத்திரை\nR3. 2 மாத்திரை\nR4. 1/2 மாத்திரை"}], "options": {"A": "L1-R1, L2-R2, L3-R3, L4-R4", "B": "L1-R4, L2-R3, L3-R2, L4-R1", "C": "L1-R2, L2-R3, L3-R1, L4-R4", "D": "L1-R3, L2-R1, L3-R4, L4-R2"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் விளக்கம்: குற்றியலுகரம் = 1/2 மாத்திரை (R2); நெடில் = 2 மாத்திரை (R3); முற்றியலுகரம் = 1 மாத்திரை (R1); குற்றியலிகரம் = 1/2 மாத்திரை (R4). வரிசை: 2 - 3 - 1 - 4."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the letter categories with their metric durations (Maathirai):\nList I (Letter Category):\nL1. Kutriyalugaram\nL2. Independent Long Vowel-Consonant\nL3. Mutriyalugaram (ugaram succeeding short vowel)\nL4. Kutriyaligaram\nList II (Metric Duration):\nR1. 1 Maathirai\nR2. 1/2 Maathirai\nR3. 2 Maathirai\nR4. 1/2 Maathirai"}], "options": {"A": "L1-R1, L2-R2, L3-R3, L4-R4", "B": "L1-R4, L2-R3, L3-R2, L4-R1", "C": "L1-R2, L2-R3, L3-R1, L4-R4", "D": "L1-R3, L2-R1, L3-R4, L4-R2"}, "explanation": "Textbook match: Kutriyalugaram=1/2, Nedil=2, Mutriyalugaram=1, Kutriyaligaram=1/2. Sequence: 2 - 3 - 1 - 4."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [{"id": "L1", "content_ta": "குற்றியலுகரம்", "content_en": "Kutriyalugaram"}, {"id": "L2", "content_ta": "தனி நெடில் உயிர்மெய் எழுத்து", "content_en": "Independent Long Vowel-Consonant"}, {"id": "L3", "content_ta": "முற்றியலுகரம்", "content_en": "Mutriyalugaram"}, {"id": "L4", "content_ta": "குற்றியலிகரம்", "content_en": "Kutriyaligaram"}], "right": [{"id": "R1", "content_ta": "1 மாத்திரை", "content_en": "1 Maathirai"}, {"id": "R2", "content_ta": "1/2 மாத்திரை", "content_en": "1/2 Maathirai"}, {"id": "R3", "content_ta": "2 மாத்திரை", "content_en": "2 Maathirai"}, {"id": "R4", "content_ta": "1/2 மாத்திரை", "content_en": "1/2 Maathirai"}]}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "7", "term": "1", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 16, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["7th_tamil", "match", "maathirai_metrics"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-02T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-02T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "7th-t1-u1-104", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "grammar", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "7", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "1", "unit_id": "ta-u1-amudhat-tamil", "lesson_id": "ta-l5-kutriyalugaram", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "word-maathirai-calc", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "இலக்கண மாத்திரை அளவைக் கணக்கிடுக:\n'கொக்கியாது' என்னும் சொல்லின் மொத்த மாத்திரை அளவு எத்தனை?"}], "options": {"A": "3 மாத்திரைகள்", "B": "3.5 மாத்திரைகள்", "C": "4 மாத்திரைகள்", "D": "4.5 மாத்திரைகள்"}, "explanation": "இலக்கணக் கணக்கீடு: கொ = குறில் உயிர்மெய் (1) + க் = மெய்யெழுத்து (0.5) + கி = குற்றியலிகரம் (0.5) + யா = நெடில் உயிர்மெய் (2) + து = குற்றியலுகரம் (0.5) = 1 + 0.5 + 0.5 + 2 + 0.5 = 4.5 (நான்கரை) மாத்திரைகள்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Calculate the metric duration (Maathirai):\nWhat is the total maathirai count for the word 'Kokkiyaadhu'?"}], "options": {"A": "3 Maathirais", "B": "3.5 Maathirais", "C": "4 Maathirais", "D": "4.5 Maathirais"}, "explanation": "Grammar calculation: Ko(1) + k(0.5) + ki(Kutriyaligaram=0.5) + yaa(2) + dhu(Kutriyalugaram=0.5) = 4.5 maathirais."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "7", "term": "1", "edition": "