{"id": "7th-t1-u1-109", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "quote_completion", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "7", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "1", "unit_id": "ta-u1-amudhat-tamil", "lesson_id": "ta-l1-engal-tamil", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "engal-tamil-poem-line", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "நாமக்கல் கவிஞரின் 'எங்கள் தமிழ்' பாடல் வரியின் விடுபட்ட சீரை நிரப்புக:\n'அருள்நெறி அறிவைத் தரலாகும் - அதுவே\nதமிழன் குரலாகும்\nபொருள்பெற யாரையும் புகழாது - போற்றா\nதாரையும் ______________'"}], "options": {"A": "இகழாது", "B": "பழிக்காது", "C": "நினையாது", "D": "தள்ளாது"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பாடல் வரி: 'பொருள்பெற யாரையும் புகழாது - போற்றாதாரையும் இகழாது' என்பது நாமக்கல் கவிஞரின் சரியான பாடல் வரியாகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Fill in the missing word in the following verse by Namakkal Kavignar ('Engal Tamil'):\n'Arulneri arivait tharalaagum - adhuve\nThamizhan kuralaagum\nPorulpera yaaraiyum pugazhaadhu - potraa\ndhaaraiyum ______________'"}], "options": {"A": "Igazhaadhu", "B": "Pazhikkaadhu", "C": "Ninaiyaadhu", "D": "Thallaadhu"}, "explanation": "Textbook verse: '...potraadhaaraiyum igazhaadhu' is the correct poetic line."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Servi