{"id": "7th-t1-u2-163", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "grammar", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "7", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "1", "unit_id": "ta-u1-amudhat-tamil", "lesson_id": "ta-l3-kapparkalai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "sandhi-combining-munneer", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "சேர்த்தெழுதுக:\n'முதுமை + நீர்' அல்லது 'மூன்று + நீர்' என்பது தமிழிலக்கணப் புணர்ச்சியில் எவ்வாறாகப் புணரும்?"}], "options": {"A": "முந்நீறு", "B": "மூநீர்", "C": "முந்நீர்", "D": "முந்நிறை"}, "explanation": "இலக்கண விதி: மூன்று + நீர் -> முதல் குறுகி 'மு' என்றாகி, 'முந்நீர்' என நகரம் மிகுந்து புணரும். ஆற்றுநீர், ஊற்றுநீர், மழைநீர் ஆகிய மூவகை நீர்களைக் குறிக்கும் சொல் 'முந்நீர்' ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Combine the base terms 'Moondru + Neer' according to Tamil grammatical sandhi rules:"}], "options": {"A": "Munneeru", "B": "Mooneer", "C": "Munneer (முந்நீர்)", "D": "Munnirai"}, "explanation": "Grammar rule: Combining produces 'Munneer', denoting rain, river, and spring waters forming the sea."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "7", "term": "1", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 30, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "u