{"id": "7th-t1-u2-191", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "grammar", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "7", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "1", "unit_id": "ta-u1-amudhat-tamil", "lesson_id": "ta-l5-indhiya-vanamagan", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "sandhi-combining-vetkappattadhu", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "சேர்த்தெழுதுக:\n'வெட்கம் + பட்டது' அல்லது 'வெட்கம் + பட்டு' என்பது புணர்ச்சி விதிகளின்படி எவ்வாறு புணரும்?"}], "options": {"A": "வெட்கம்பட்டது", "B": "வெட்கபட்டது", "C": "வெட்கப்பட்டது", "D": "வெட்குப்பட்டது"}, "explanation": "இலக்கண விதி: 'மவ்வீறு ஒற்றழிந்து உயிரீறு ஒப்பவும்' என்ற விதிப்படி மகர மெய் கெட்டு, வருமொழி முதலிலுள்ள வல்லின பகரம் மிகுந்து 'வெட்கப்பட்டது' எனப் புணரும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Combine the terms 'Vetkam + Pattadhu' according to Tamil grammatical sandhi rules:"}], "options": {"A": "Vetkampattadhu", "B": "Vetkapattadhu", "C": "Vetkappattadhu (வெட்கப்பட்டது)", "D": "Vetkuppattadhu"}, "explanation": "Grammar rule: Terminal 'm' drops and incoming 'p' consonant doubles, yielding 'Vetkappattadhu'."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "7", "term": "1", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 41, "chapter": null, "section"