{"id": "7th-t2-u1-q018", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "7", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "2", "unit_id": "ta-t2-u1-kalvi", "lesson_id": "lesson-01-naladiyar", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ta-t2-u1-sandhi-match", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பாடப்பகுதிச் சொற்களை அவற்றின் பிரித்தெழுதுதலோடு பொருத்துக:\n(a) நாடெங்கும் - 1. குறை + எனவே\n(b) குறையெனவே - 2. நாடு + எங்கும்\n(c) வாய்த்தீயில் - 3. செறின் + வவ்வார்\n(d) செறின்வவ்வார் - 4. வாய்த்து + ஈயில்"}], "options": {"A": "a-1, b-2, c-3, d-4", "B": "a-2, b-1, c-4, d-3", "C": "a-4, b-3, c-2, d-1", "D": "a-2, b-4, c-1, d-3"}, "explanation": "நாடெங்கும் = நாடு + எங்கும் (2); குறையெனவே = குறை + எனவே (1); வாய்த்தீயில் = வாய்த்து + ஈயில் (4); செறின்வவ்வார் = செறின் + வவ்வார் (3). சரியான வரிசை: 2, 1, 4, 3."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match compound words with their split forms:\n(a) Naadengum - 1. Kurai + Enave\n(b) Kuraiyenave - 2. Naadu + Engum\n(c) Vaytheeyil - 3. Serin + Vavvaar\n(d) Serinvavvaar - 4. Vaythu + Eeyil"}], "options": {"A": "a-1, b-2, c-3, d-4", "B": "a-2, b-1, c-4, d-3", "C": "a-4, b-3, c-2, d-1", "D": "a-2, b-4, c-1, d-3"}, "explanation": "Proper splitting: Naadengum = Naadu + Engum; Kuraiyenave = Kurai + Enave; Vaytheeyil = Vaythu + Eeyil; Serinvavvaar = Serin + Vavvaar. Match: 2, 1, 4, 3 (B)."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [{"id": "L1", "content_ta": "நாடெங்கும்", "content_en": "Naadengum"}, {"id": "L2", "content_ta": "குறையெனவே", "content_en": "Kuraiyenave"}, {"id": "L3", "content_ta": "வாய்த்தீயில்", "content_en": "Vaytheeyil"}, {"id": "L4", "content_ta": "செறின்வவ்வார்", "content_en": "Serinvavvaar"}], "right": [{"id": "R1", "content_ta": "குறை + எனவே", "content_en": "Kurai + Enave"}, {"id": "R2", "content_ta": "நாடு + எங்கும்", "content_en": "Naadu + Engum"}, {"id": "R3", "content_ta": "செறின் + வவ்வார்", "content_en": "Serin + Vavvaar"}, {"id": "R4", "content_ta": "வாய்த்து + ஈயில்", "content_en": "Vaythu + Eeyil"}]}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "7", "term": "2", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 6, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["grammar", "punarchi", "matching"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "7th-t2-u1-q020", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "grammar", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "7", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "2", "unit_id": "ta-t2-u1-kalvi", "lesson_id": "lesson-01-naladiyar", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ta-t2-u1-metrics-mathirai", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'வைப்புழி' என்னும் சொல்லின் மொத்த மாத்திரை அளவைக் கணக்கிடுக:\n(குறில் = 1 மாத்திரை, நெடில் = 2 மாத்திரை, மெய்/ஒற்று = 1/2 மாத்திரை)"}], "options": {"A": "3 மாத்திரை", "B": "4 மாத்திரை", "C": "3.5 மாத்திரை", "D": "4.5 மாத்திரை"}, "explanation": "'வைப்புழி' மாத்திரை கணக்கீடு:\nவை (நெடில்) = 2 மாத்திரை\nப் (மெய்) = 1/2 மாத்திரை\nபு (குறில்) = 1 மாத்திரை\nழி (குறில்) = 1 மாத்திரை\nகூட்டுத்தொகை = 2 + 0.5 + 1 + 1 = 4.5 மாத்திரை."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Calculate the total prosodic metric value (Maathirai) of the word 'Vaippuzhi':\n(Short vowel = 1, Long vowel = 2, Consonant = 1/2)"}], "options": {"A": "3 Maathirai", "B": "4 Maathirai", "C": "3.5 Maathirai", "D": "4.5 Maathirai"}, "explanation": "Metrics for 'Vaippuzhi': Vai (long) = 2; p (consonant) = 0.5; pu (short) = 1; zhi (short) = 1. Total = 2 + 0.5 + 1 + 1 = 4.5 Maathirai."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporat