{"id": "7th-t2-pyq-q305", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "odd_one_out", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "7", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "2", "unit_id": "ta-t2-u2-kalai", "lesson_id": "lesson-08-thozhirpeyar", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ta-t2-pyq-odd-thozhirpeyar-root-category", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தொழிற்பெயர் வகைகளில் 'முதனிலைத் தொழிற்பெயர்' அல்லாத ஒன்றைக் கண்டறிக:"}], "options": {"A": "இடி", "B": "கொதி", "C": "சூடு", "D": "வாழ்"}, "explanation": "இடி, கொதி, வாழ் என்பவை விகுதி பெறாமல் பகுதி மட்டுமே நிற்கும் 'முதனிலைத் தொழிற்பெயர்கள்'. 'சூடு' (சுடு->சூடு) என்பது முதனிலை நீண்டு திரிந்த 'முதனிலை திரிந்த தொழிற்பெயர்' ஆகும். எனவே 'C' பொருந்தாதது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Identify the word which is NOT a primary root verbal noun (Muthannilai Thozhirpeyar):"}], "options": {"A": "Idi", "B": "Kothi", "C": "Soodu", "D": "Vaazh"}, "explanation": "'Soodu' is a lengthened root verbal noun (Muthannilai Thirintha Thozhirpeyar), whereas the others are unlengthened root nouns. C is the odd one."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "7", "term": "2", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 37, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": n