{"id": "7th-t3-u1-q099", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "7", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "3", "unit_id": "ta-t3-u1-nagarigam", "lesson_id": "lesson-04-vazhakku", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ta-t3-u1-thaguthi-vazhakku-examples-match", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தகுதி வழக்கின் பிரிவுகளையும் அவற்றுக்குரிய சான்றுகளையும் பொருத்துக:\n(a) இடக்கரடக்கல் - 1. செத்தார் -> இயற்கை எய்தினார்\n(b) மங்கலம் - 2. கால் கழுவி வந்தான்\n(c) குழூஉக்குறி (பொற்கொல்லர்) - 3. ஆடையைக் 'காரை' எனல்\n(d) குழூஉக்குறி (யானைப் பாகர்) - 4. பொன்னைப் 'பறி' எனல்"}], "options": {"A": "a-1, b-2, c-3, d-4", "B": "a-2, b-1, c-4, d-3", "C": "a-2, b-4, c-1, d-3", "D": "a-3, b-1, c-4, d-2"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக்கம் 15:\nஇடக்கரடக்கல் = கால் கழுவி வந்தான் (2)\nமங்கலம் = செத்தார் -> இயற்கை எய்தினார் (1)\nகுழூஉக்குறி (பொற்கொல்லர்) = பொன்னைப் பறி எனல் (4)\nகுழூஉக்குறி (யானைப் பாகர்) = ஆடையைக் காரை எனல் (3).\nவரிசை: 2, 1, 4, 3."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the Thaguthi Vazhakku divisions with their exact examples:\n(a) Idakkaradakkal - 1. Sethaar -> Iyarkkai eithinaar\n(b) Mangalam - 2. Kaal kazhuvi vanthan\n(c) Kuzhoo-ukkuri (Goldsmith) - 3. Cloth as 'Kaarai'\n(d) Kuzhoo-ukkuri (Mahout) - 4. Gold as 'Pari'"}], "options": {"A": "a-1, b-2, c-3, d-4", "B": "a-2, b-1, c-4, d-3", "C": "a-2, b-4, c-1, d-3", "D": "a-3, b-1, c-4, d-2"}, "explanation": "Correct alignment: Idakkaradakkal = 2, Mangalam = 1, Goldsmith = 4, Mahout = 3. Sequence: 2, 1, 4, 3."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [{"id": "L1", "content_ta": "இடக்கரடக்கல்", "content_en": "Idakkaradakkal"}, {"id": "L2", "content_ta": "மங்கலம்", "content_en": "Mangalam"}, {"id": "L3", "content_ta": "குழூஉக்குறி (பொற்கொல்லர்)", "content_en": "Kuzhoo-ukkuri (Goldsmith)"}, {"id": "L4", "content_ta": "குழூஉக்குறி (யானைப் பாகர்)", "content_en": "Kuzhoo-ukkuri (Mahout)"}], "right": [{"id": "R1", "content_ta": "செத்தார் -> இயற்கை எய்தினார்", "content_en": "Sethaar -> Iyarkkai eithinaar"}, {"id": "R2", "content_ta": "கால் கழுவி வந்தான்", "content_en": "Kaal kazhuvi vanthan"}, {"id": "R3", "content_ta": "ஆடையைக் 'காரை' எனல்", "content_en": "Calling cloth 'Kaarai'"}, {"id": "R4", "content_ta": "பொன்னைப் 'பறி' எனல்", "content_en": "Calling gold 'Pari'"}]}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "7", "term": "3", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 15, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["vazhakku", "grammar", "matching"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "7th-t3-u1-q100", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "7", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "3", "unit_id": "ta-t3-u1-nagarigam", "lesson_id": "lesson-04-vazhakku", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ta-t3-u1-poli-letter-shift-match", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "போலி வகைகளையும் அவற்றின் எழுத்து மாற்றச் சான்றுகளையும் பொருத்துக:\n(a) முதற்போலி - 1. நிலம் -> நிலன்\n(b) இடைப்போலி - 2. பந்தல் -> பந்தர்\n(c) கடைப்போலி (மகரம் -> நகரம்) - 3. பசல் -> பைசல்\n(d) கடைப்போலி (லகரம் -> ரகரம்) - 4. அமச்சு -> அமைச்சு"}], "options": {"A": "a-1, b-4, c-2, d-3", "B": "a-3, b-1, c-4, d-2", "C": "a-3, b-4, c-1, d-2", "D": "a-4, b-3, c-1, d-2"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக்கம் 15:\nமுதற்போலி = பசல் -> பைசல் (3)\nஇடைப்போலி = அமச்சு -> அமைச்சு (4)\nகடைப்போலி (மகரம்->நகரம்) = நிலம் -> நிலன் (1)\nகடைப்போலி (லகரம்->ரகரம்) = பந்தல் -> பந்தர் (சாம்பல் -> சாம்பர்) (2).\nவரிசை: 3, 4, 1, 2."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the categories of Poli with their phonetic transformations:\n(a) Mutharpoli - 1. Nilam -> Nilan\n(b) Idaippoli - 2. Panthal -> Panthar\n(c) Kadaippoli (m -> n) - 3. Pasal -> Paisal\n(d) Kadaippoli (l -> r) - 4. Amachu -> Amaichu"}], "options": {"A": "a-1, b-4, c-2, d-3", "B": "a-3, b-1, c-4, d-2", "C": "a-3, b-4, c-1, d-2", "D": "a-4, b-3, c-1, d-2"}, "explanation": "Correct match: Mutharpoli = 3, Idaippoli = 4, Kadaippoli (m->n) = 1, Kadaippoli (l->r) = 2. Sequence: 3, 4, 1, 2."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [{"id": "L1", "content_ta": "முதற்போலி", "content_en": "Mutharpoli"}, {"id": "L2", "content_ta": "இடைப்போலி", "content_en": "Idaippoli"}, {"id": "L3", "content_ta": "கடைப்போலி (மகரம் -> நகரம்)", "content_en": "Kadaippoli (m -> n)"}, {"id": "L4", "content_ta": "கடைப்போலி (லகரம் -> ரகரம்)", "content_en": "Kadaippoli (l -> r)"}], "right": [{"id": "R1", "content_ta": "நிலம் -> நிலன்", "content_en": "Nilam -> Nilan"}, {"id": "R2", "content_ta": "பந்தல் -> பந்தர்", "content_en": "Panthal -> Panthar"}, {"id": "R3", "content_ta": "பசல் -> பைசல்", "content_en": "Pasal -> Paisal"}, {"id": "R4", "content_ta": "அமச்சு -> அமைச்சு", "content_en": "Amachu -> Amaichu"}]}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "7", "term": "3", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 15, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["vazhakku", "grammar", "poli", "matching"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
