{"id": "7th-t3-u4-q385", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "grammar", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "7", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "3", "unit_id": "ta-t3-pyq-bridging", "lesson_id": "lesson-04-vazhakku", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ta-t3-pyq-poli-types", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "TNPSC போலி வகைகளில் 'பந்தல் -> பந்தர்', 'ஐந்து -> அஞ்சு' என்பன முறையே எவ்வகைப் போலிகள் ஆகும்?"}], "options": {"A": "கடைப்போலி - முற்றுப்போலி", "B": "முதற்போலி - இடைப்போலி", "C": "இடைப்போலி - கடைப்போலி", "D": "முற்றுப்போலி - முதற்போலி"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக்கம் 16: சொல்லின் இறுதியில் லகரத்திற்குப் பதிலாக ரகரம் அமைந்த 'பந்தர்' கடைப்போலி ஆகும்; சொல்லின் எல்லா எழுத்துகளும் முற்றிலும் மாறி ஒரே பொருள் தரும் 'அஞ்சு' என்பது முற்றுப்போலி ஆகும். எனவே A சரியான விடை."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In TNPSC examinations, 'Panthal -> Panthar' and 'Ainthu -> Anju' represent which types of Poli (word-variant letter substitutes)?"}], "options": {"A": "Kadaippoli - Mutruppoli", "B": "Mutharppoli - Idaippoli", "C": "Idaippoli - Kadaippoli", "D": "Mutruppoli - Mutharppoli"}, "explanation": "'Panthar' alters the terminal consonant (l -> r), forming Kadaippoli. 'Anju' completely replaces all phonemes while retaining meaning, forming Mutruppoli."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "7", "term": "3", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 16, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["tnpsc_pyq", "poli", "kadaippoli", "mutruppoli", "grammar"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "7th-t3-u4-q386", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "grammar", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "7", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "3", "unit_id": "ta-t3-pyq-bridging", "lesson_id": "lesson-02-thirunelveli", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ta-t3-pyq-metrics-thirunelveli", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'திருநெல்வேலி' என்ற சொல்லின் மொத்த மாத்திரை அளவைக் கணக்கிடுக:"}], "options": {"A": "5.5 மாத்திரைகள்", "B": "6.5 மாத்திரைகள்", "C": "7.0 மாத்திரைகள்", "D": "7.5 மாத்திரைகள்"}, "explanation": "மாத்திரை கணக்கீடு:\nதி (குறில்) = 1\nரு (குறில்) = 1\nநெ (குறில்) = 1\nல் (மெய்) = 0.5\nவே (நெடில்) = 2\nலி (குறில்) = 1\nகூடுதல் = 1 + 1 + 1 + 0.5 + 2 + 1 = 6.5 மாத்திரைகள்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Calculate the total Maathirai count for the historical place name 'Tirunelveli':"}], "options": {"A": "5.5 Maathirais", "B": "6.5 Maathirais", "C": "7.0 Maathirais", "D": "7.5 Maathirais"}, "explanation": "Metrics calculation: Thi (1) + ru (1) + ne (1) + l (0.5) + vae (2) + li (1) = 6.5 Maathirais."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "7", "term": "3", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 4, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["tnpsc_pyq", "metrics", "maathirai", "thirunelveli", "grammar"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "7th-t3-u4-q387", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "grammar", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "7", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "3", "unit_id": "ta-t3-u3-maanudam", "lesson_id": "lesson-14-vina-vidai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ta-t3-pyq-vina-vidai-app", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'நீ நாளை பள்ளிக்கு வருவாயா?' என்ற வினாவிற்கு 'வராமல் இருப்பேனா?' என்று விடையளிப்பது எவ்வகை விடை என TNPSC-ல் அடிக்கடி வினவப்படுகிறது?"}], "options": {"A": "மறை விடை", "B": "ஏவல் விடை", "C": "வினா எதிர் வினாதல் விடை", "D": "உற்றது உரைத்தல் விடை"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக்கம் 60: வினாவிற்கு விடையாக மற்றொரு வினாவையே திருப்பிக் கேட்பதால் இது 'வினா எதிர் வினாதல் விடை' ஆகும் (டிஎன்பிஎஸ்சி தேர்வுகளில் மிகவும் பொதுவான வினா)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Replying 'Will I fail to come?' to 'Will you come to school tomorrow?' is what type of answer frequently asked in TNPSC exams?"}], "options": {"A": "Marai Vidai", "B": "Eeval Vidai", "C": "Vina Ethir Vinaathal Vidai", "D": "Urrathu Uraithal Vidai"}, "explanation": "Page 60: Countering a question with another rhetorical question is Vina Ethir Vinaathal Vidai, a standard repeated TNPSC question."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "7", "term": "3", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 60, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["tnpsc_pyq", "vina_ethir_vinaathal", "grammar"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}

