{"id": "8th-u1-q108", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "odd_one_out", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-05-eluthukalin-pirappu", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ta-8th-u1-odd-lip-rounding", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "உதடுகளைக் குவிப்பதால் பிறக்கும் உயிர் எழுத்துகளின் குழுவில் பொருந்தாத எழுத்தினைக் கண்டறிக:"}], "options": {"A": "ஊ", "B": "ஓ", "C": "ஔ", "D": "ஐ"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக்கம் 17: 'உ, ஊ, ஒ, ஓ, ஔ' ஆகிய ஐந்து எழுத்துகளும் உதடுகளைக் குவிப்பதால் பிறக்கின்றன. 'ஐ' என்பது வாய் திறப்பதோடு நாவின் அடி ஓரம் மேல்வாய்ப் பல்லைப் பொருந்துவதால் பிறக்கும் எழுத்து ஆகும். எனவே 'ஐ' பொருந்தாதது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Find the ODD letter out that does NOT belong to the group of vowels articulated by pursing/rounding the lips:"}], "options": {"A": "Oo", "B": "Oh", "C": "Au", "D": "Ai"}, "explanation": "Textbook page 17: U, Oo, O, Oh, Au are lip-rounded vowels. 'Ai' is articulated with mouth opening and tongue edges touching upper teeth."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 17, "chapter