{"id": "9th-u1-q105", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "quote_completion", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-03-tamiloviyam", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-viral-nuniyil-line", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'விரல் நுனியில் விரிகிறது உலகம் — கனிப்பொறிக்குள்\nதமிழோவியமாய் ஒளிர்கிறது!'\nஇக்கவிதை வரிகளில் தமிழோவியம் எவ்வளர்ச்சியைக் கொண்டாடுகிறது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "இணையம் மற்றும் கணினித் தமிழ் வளர்ச்சி", "B": "பழங்காலக் கல்வெட்டுகள்", "C": "அச்சுப் பதிப்பு கலை", "D": "ஓலைச்சுவடிப் பாதுகாப்பு"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக். 10: 'என்பென்றும் நிலைபெற்ற தமிழே! தொழில் நுட்பத்தை ஏற்றுத் தற்கால இணைய உலகிலும் கனிப்பொறித் தமிழாய் ஒளிர்கிறாய்' என அறிவியல் வளர்ச்சியைப் போற்றுகிறார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In the poem 'Tamiloviyam', what modern evolutionary milestone of Tamil is celebrated through the imagery of the computer screen?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "The emergence of Digital, Internet, and Computational Tamil", "B": "Ancient rock cut edicts", "C": "19th century letterpress printing", "D": "Preservation of palm-leaf bundles"}, "explanation": "The verse applauds the adaptation of Tamil into cyber technology, computers, and the internet."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 10, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 10", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["tamiloviyam", "digital_tamil", "quote_completion"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u1-q106", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "direct", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-04-aaram-thinai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-1958-kalavaram-year", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "ஆறாம் திணை பாடப்பகுதியில் ஆசிரியர் அ. முத்துலிங்கம் கொழும்பில் தாம் சந்தித்ததாகக் குறிப்பிடும் இனக்கலவர ஆண்டு எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1947", "B": "1958", "C": "1971", "D": "1983"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக். 12: '1958-ஆம் ஆண்டு கலவரத்தில் மவுண்ட் லவினியா வீட்டிலிருந்து வெளியேற நேர்ந்தது' என்று முத்துலிங்கம் குறிப்பிடுகிறார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In 'Aaram Thinai', which specific year of ethnic rioting in Colombo is cited by A. Muthulingam as the beginning of his displacement?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1947", "B": "1958", "C": "1971", "D": "1983"}, "explanation": "Page 12 explicitly dates his family's initial evacuation from Mount Lavinia to the 1958 riots."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 12, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 12", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "pr