{"id": "9th-u1-q111", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "direct", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-04-aaram-thinai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-thinai-meaning-grammar", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தொல்காப்பியப் பொருள் இலக்கணத்தில் 'திணை' என்னும் சொல்லிற்குரிய நேரடிப் பொருள் என்ன?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "பயிர் வகை", "B": "மலைப்பகுதி", "C": "ஒழுக்கம் / நிலம்", "D": "போர்க்களம்"}, "explanation": "பொருள் இலக்கணத்தில் திணை என்பது மக்களின் ஒழுக்கத்தையும் (அகம்/புற ஒழுக்கம்) நிலப்பரப்பையும் (ஐவகை நிலம்) குறிக்கும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In classical Tamil poetics (Porul Ilakkanam), what is the primary semantic meaning of the term 'Thinai'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "A variety of grain (Millet)", "B": "Mountain slope", "C": "Conduct / Moral code / Geographical Eco-zone", "D": "Battleground"}, "explanation": "In literary grammar, Thinai signifies moral conduct (Ozhu-kkam) intrinsically linked to an environmental land tract."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 12, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil