{"id": "9th-u1-q140", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "grammar", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-05-eluthu-alapedai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-kurukkangal-saarbhezhuthu", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "சார்பெழுத்தின் பத்து வகைகளுள் 'அளபெடை' வகையைச் சேர்ந்தவை எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "குற்றியலுகரம், குற்றியலிகரம்", "B": "ஐகாரக்குறுக்கம், ஔகாரக்குறுக்கம்", "C": "மகரக்குறுக்கம், ஆய்தக்குறுக்கம்", "D": "உயிரளபெடை, ஒற்றளபெடை"}, "explanation": "சார்பெழுத்துகள் பத்தில் நீண்டு ஒலிக்கும் தன்மை கொண்டவை 'உயிரளபெடை', 'ஒற்றளபெடை' ஆகிய இரண்டு மட்டுமே ஆகும். மற்றவை குறுகி ஒலிப்பவை அல்லது சார்பு நிலைகள்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Among the ten varieties of dependent letters (Saarbhezhuthu), which two specifically represent the phenomenon of elongation?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Kutriyalugaram and Kutriyaligaram", "B": "Aikarakkurukkam and Aukarakkurukkam", "C": "Makarakkurukkam and Aythakkurukkam", "D": "Uyiralapedai and Otralapedai"}, "explanation": "Uyiralapedai (vocalic elongation) and Otralapedai (consonantal elongation) are the two distinct elongation varieties of Saarbhezhuthu."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Edu