{"id": "9th-u2-q124", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u2-iyarkai", "lesson_id": "lesson-04-pagupadha-uruppilakkanam", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-pagupadha-uruppilakkanam", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'வந்தனன்' என்னும் சொல்லில் 'வா' என்பது 'வ' எனத் திரிந்ததும், 'த்' என்பது 'ந்' என மாறியதும் எவ்வகைப் பகுபத உறுப்பாகும்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "எழுத்துப் பேறு", "B": "சாரியை", "C": "சந்தி", "D": "விகாரம்"}, "explanation": "விகாரம் என்பது தனி உறுப்பு அன்று. பகுபத உறுப்புகளில் பகுதியிலும் சந்தியிலும் ஏற்படும் வடிவ மாற்றமே விகாரம் எனப்படும். வந்தனன் = வா(வ) + த்(ந்) + த் + அன் + அன் என்பதில் இவை விகாரங்கள் ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In 'Vandhanan', the shortening of 'Vaa' to 'Va' and mutation of 'th' to 'n' are termed as what?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Ezhutthuppaeru", "B": "Saariyai", "C": "Sandhi", "D": "Vigaaram (Phonetic modification / mutation)"}, "explanation": "Vigaaram is not an independent morpheme but represents internal phonetic alterations in root or sandhi."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-202