{"id": "9th-u2-q125", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u2-iyarkai", "lesson_id": "lesson-04-pagupadha-uruppilakkanam", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-pagupadha-uruppilakkanam", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'செய்யாதே' (செய் + ய் + ஆ + த் + ஏ) என்ற சொல்லின் பகுபத உறுப்பிலக்கணத்தில் 'த்' என்பது என்ன?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "எழுத்துப் பேறு", "B": "இறந்தகால இடைநிலை", "C": "சந்தி", "D": "சாரியை"}, "explanation": "'செய்யாதே' என்பதில் 'ஆ' என்பது எதிர்மறை இடைநிலை; எனவே அதற்குப் பின் வரும் 'த்' காலத்தைக் காட்டாமல் சாரியை இடத்தில் வந்ததால் இது 'எழுத்துப் பேறு' ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In the morphemic analysis of 'Seyyaadhae' (sey + y + aa + th + ae), what role does 'th' play?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Ezhutthuppaeru", "B": "Past tense medial", "C": "Sandhi", "D": "Saariyai"}, "explanation": "Following the negative medial 'aa', the consonant 'th' indicates no tense and acts in the saariyai position, hence it is an Ezhutthuppaeru."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 42, "chapter": null, "section": null, 