{"id": "9th-u2-q131", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u2-iyarkai", "lesson_id": "lesson-04-pagupadha-uruppilakkanam", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-pagupadha-uruppilakkanam", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பகுபத உறுப்புகள் ஆறினுள் 'தனி உறுப்பு அல்லாத ஒன்று' எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "பகுதி", "B": "இடைநிலை", "C": "விகாரம்", "D": "சாரியை"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் கூற்று: 'விகாரம் என்பது தனி உறுப்பு அன்று. இது பகுபத உறுப்புகளில் பகுதியிலும் சந்தியிலும் ஏற்படும் வடிவ மாற்றமே ஆகும்.'"}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Among the six constituents of Pagupadham, which one is explicitly NOT an independent morpheme?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Paguthi", "B": "Idainilai", "C": "Vigaaram", "D": "Saariyai"}, "explanation": "Textbook rule: 'Vigaaram is not an independent constituent; it is merely an internal morpho-phonemic change in Paguthi or Sandhi.'"}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 42, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 42", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {