{"id": "9th-u2-q159", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u2-iyarkai", "lesson_id": "lesson-05-evaluation-and-pyq", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-iyal2-evaluation-pyq", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'மணிநீரும் மண்ணும் மலையும் அணிநிழற் காடும் உடையது அரண்' (குறள் 742) - இக்குறளில் நாட்டின் சிறந்த அரண்களுள் வள்ளுவர் எதற்கு முதலிடம் தந்துள்ளார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "உயர்ந்த மலை", "B": "பரந்த மணல் நிலம்", "C": "மணிநீர் (தெளிந்த நீர்வளம்)", "D": "அடர்ந்த நிழல் காடு"}, "explanation": "வள்ளுவர் அரண்களை வரிசைப்படுத்தும்போது 'மணிநீர்' என்பதனை முதலாக வைக்கிறார். தெளிந்த நீர்வளமே ஒரு நாட்டின் முதலாவது சிறந்த அரணாகத் திகழ்கிறது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In Kural 742 ('Manineerum mannum malaiyum aninizhar kaadum udaiyadhu aran'), to which element does Valluvar give foremost priority?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Towering mountain", "B": "Expansive earth", "C": "Manineer (Crystal pure water resource)", "D": "Dense shaded woodland"}, "explanation": "Thiruvalluvar places sparkling water ('Manineer') at the very forefront of a kingdom's defensive fortresses."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Cor