{"id": "9th-u4-q125", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u4", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u4-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "verb-irundhaan-aux", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"அவன் தூங்கிக் கொண்டிருந்தான்\" - இதில் துணைவினையாக அமைந்துள்ள சொல் எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "கொண்டிருந்தான்", "B": "தூங்கி", "C": "அவன்", "D": "தூங்கு"}, "explanation": "இத்தொடரில் 'தூங்கி' என்பது முதல் வினை (தூங்குதல் தொழில்). 'கொண்டிருந்தான்' என்பது செயல் தொடர்ந்து நிகழ்வதைக் காட்டும் தொடர் காலத் துணைவினையாக அமைந்துள்ளது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In \"Avan thoongik kondirundhaan\" (He was sleeping), which element serves as the auxiliary verb?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "kondirundhaan", "B": "thoongi", "C": "avan", "D": "thoongu"}, "explanation": "'Thoongi' is the main lexical verb; 'kondirundhaan' acts as the progressive aspectual auxiliary verb."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 97, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 97", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_ye