{"id": "9th-u4-q152", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u4", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u4-l6", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "pyq-muthulakshmi-devadasi", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "[TNPSC முந்தைய ஆண்டு வினா] சென்னை சட்டமன்றத்தில் டாக்டர் முத்துலட்சுமி ரெட்டி அவர்கள் தேவதாசி முறை ஒழிப்பு மசோதாவை முன்மொழிந்த ஆண்டு எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1926", "B": "1928", "C": "1929", "D": "1930"}, "explanation": "டாக்டர் முத்துலட்சுமி ரெட்டி 1930 ஆம் ஆண்டு சென்னை சட்டமன்றத்தில் தேவதாசி முறை ஒழிப்பு மசோதாவை முன்மொழிந்தார். இச்சட்டம் பல்வேறு போராட்டங்களுக்குப் பிறகு 1947-ல் நிறைவேறியது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "[TNPSC Previous Year Question] In which year did Dr. Muthulakshmi Reddi introduce the Devadasi System Abolition Bill in the Madras Legislative Council?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1926", "B": "1928", "C": "1929", "D": "1930"}, "explanation": "Dr. Muthulakshmi Reddi moved the historic resolution to abolish the Devadasi system in 1930, which culminated in the Madras Devadasis (Prevention of Dedication) Act of 1947."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year",