{"id": "9th-u5-q126", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u5", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u5-l4", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "vallinam-rules-matching", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பொருத்துக (இலக்கண விதி - சான்று):\n(a) சுட்டுத் திரிபு - 1. மல்லிகைப் பூ\n(b) இரண்டாம் வேற்றுமை விரி - 2. அந்தப் பக்கம்\n(c) உவமைத்தொகை - 3. கதவைத் திற\n(d) இருபெயரொட்டுப் பண்புத்தொகை - 4. மலர்க்கை", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(a)-1, (b)-3, (c)-4, (d)-2", "B": "(a)-2, (b)-3, (c)-4, (d)-1", "C": "(a)-3, (b)-2, (c)-1, (d)-4", "D": "(a)-4, (b)-1, (c)-2, (d)-3"}, "explanation": "சரியான பொருத்தம்:\n(a) சுட்டுத் திரிபு - அந்தப் பக்கம் (2)\n(b) இரண்டாம் வேற்றுமை விரி - கதவைத் திற (3)\n(c) உவமைத்தொகை - மலர்க்கை (4)\n(d) இருபெயரொட்டுப் பண்புத்தொகை - மல்லிகைப் பூ (1)"}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the sandhi rules with their correct exemplars:\n(a) Demonstrative mutation - 1. Malligaip poo\n(b) Accusative case expansion - 2. Andhap pakkam\n(c) Simile compound - 3. Kadhavaith thira\n(d) Binomial quality compound - 4. Malarkkai", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(a)-1, (b)-3, (c)-4, (d)-2", "B": "(a)-2, (b)-3, (c)-4, (d)-1", "C": "(a)-3, (b)-2, (c)-1, (d)-4", "D": "(a)-4, (b)-1, (c)-2, (d)-3"}, "explanation": "Accurate mapping: Demonstrative = Andhap pakkam (2); Accusative = Kadhavaith thira (3); Simile = Malarkkai (4); Binomial = Malligaip poo (1)."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 130, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 130", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_5", "grammar", "matching"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u5-q127", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u5", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u5-l4", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "vallinam-fractions", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'அரை, பாதி' போன்ற பின்னச் சொற்களுக்குப் பின் வல்லினம் என்னவாகும்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "வல்லினம் மிகாது", "B": "மெல்லினம் மிகும்", "C": "வல்லினம் மிகும் (அரைக்கிலோ, பாதிப்பங்கு)", "D": "இடையினம் மிகும்"}, "explanation": "'அரை', 'பாதி' போன்ற பின்னப் பெயர்களுக்குப் பின் வரும் வல்லினம் கண்டிப்பாக மிகும். எ.கா: அரை + கிலோ = அரைக்கிலோ; பாதி + பங்கு = பாதிப்பங்கு."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What sandhi change occurs after fractional nouns such as 'Arai' (half) and 'Paadhi' (portion)?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Plosives do not double", "B": "Nasals double", "C": "Plosives obligatorily double (e.g., Araikkilo, Paadhippangu)", "D": "Medials double"}, "explanation": "Fractional terms 'arai' and 'paadhi' cause mandatory plosive doubling."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 130, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Pa