{"id": "9th-u6-q136", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "analysis", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u6", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u6-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "punarchi-terms-matching", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பொருத்துக (புணர்ச்சிச் சொற்கள் - இலக்கணக் குறியீடு):\n(a) மணி - 1. மெய்முதல்\n(b) பொன் - 2. உயிர்முதல்\n(c) இலை - 3. மெய்யீறு\n(d) மரம் - 4. உயிரீறு", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(a)-2, (b)-1, (c)-4, (d)-3", "B": "(a)-3, (b)-4, (c)-1, (d)-2", "C": "(a)-1, (b)-2, (c)-3, (d)-4", "D": "(a)-4, (b)-3, (c)-2, (d)-1"}, "explanation": "மணி (ண்+இ) = உயிரீறு; பொன் (ன்) = மெய்யீறு; இலை (இ) = உயிர்முதல்; மரம் (ம்+அ) = மெய்முதல். சரியான வரிசை: 4, 3, 2, 1."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the words with their sandhi technical designations:\n(a) Mani - 1. Meymudhal\n(b) Pon - 2. Uyirmudhal\n(c) Ilai - 3. Meyyeeru\n(d) Maram - 4. Uyireeru", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(a)-2, (b)-1, (c)-4, (d)-3", "B": "(a)-3, (b)-4, (c)-1, (d)-2", "C": "(a)-1, (b)-2, (c)-3, (d)-4", "D": "(a)-4, (b)-3, (c)-2, (d)-1"}, "explanation": "Mani (ends in 'i') = Uyireeru (4); Pon (ends in 'n') = Meyyeeru (3); Ilai (begins with 'i') = Uyirmudhal (2); Maram (begins with 'm') = Meymudhal (1). Sequence: 4, 3, 2, 1."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "