{"id": "9th-u6-q148", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "comprehension", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u6", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u6-l6", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "books-authors-matching", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பொருத்துக (நூல்கள் - ஆசிரியர்கள்):\n(a) அக்னிச் சிறகுகள் - 1. மயில்சாமி அண்ணாதுரை\n(b) மின்மினி - 2. சுஜாதா\n(c) ஏன்? எதற்கு? எப்படி? - 3. ஆயிஷா இரா. நடராசன்\n(d) கையருகே நிலா - 4. அப்துல் கலாம் (தமிழில் மு. சிவலிங்கம்)", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(a)-3, (b)-4, (c)-1, (d)-2", "B": "(a)-2, (b)-1, (c)-4, (d)-3", "C": "(a)-1, (b)-3, (c)-2, (d)-4", "D": "(a)-4, (b)-3, (c)-2, (d)-1"}, "explanation": "அக்னிச் சிறகுகள் = அப்துல் கலாம்/மு.சிவலிங்கம் (4); மின்மினி = ஆயிஷா இரா. நடராசன் (3); ஏன்? எதற்கு? எப்படி? = சுஜாதா (2); கையருகே நிலா = மயில்சாமி அண்ணாதுரை (1). சரியான வரிசை: 4, 3, 2, 1."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the books with their respective authors:\n(a) Agni Siragugal - 1. Mayilsamy Annadurai\n(b) Minmini - 2. Sujatha\n(c) Yen? Yedharku? Yeppadi? - 3. Ayisha R. Natarajan\n(d) Kaiyaruge Nila - 4. Abdul Kalam (trans. Mu. Sivalingam)", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(a)-3, (b)-4, (c)-1, (d)-2", "B": "(a)-2, (b)-1, (c)-4, (d)-3", "C": "(a)-1, (b)-3, (c)-2, (d)-4", "D": "(a)-4, (b)-3, (c)-2, (d)-1"}, "explanation": "Agni Siragugal -> Abdul Kalam/Sivalingam (4); Minmini -> Ayisha Natarajan (3); Yen? Yedharku? Yeppadi? -> Sujatha (2); Kaiyaruge Nila -> Mayilsamy Annadurai (1). Sequence: 4, 3, 2, 1."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 118, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 118", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_6", "books_authors", "matching"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
