{"id": "9th-u7-q068", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "easy", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u7", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u7-l2", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "sollum-porulum-isai-netri", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "சீவக சிந்தாமணிப் பாடலில் வரும் 'இசை', 'நெற்றி' என்னும் சொற்களின் பொருள் யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "இன்னிசை, முகம்", "B": "பாடல், தலை", "C": "ஒலி, நெற்றிப்பட்டம்", "D": "புகழ், உச்சி"}, "explanation": "பாடலின் சொல்லும் பொருளும் பகுதியில் 'இசை' என்றால் புகழ் என்றும், 'நெற்றி' என்றால் உச்சி (மரத்தின் உச்சி) என்றும் குறிப்பிடப்பட்டுள்ளது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In the Sivaka Chinthamani verse vocabulary, what do 'Isai' (இசை) and 'Netri' (நெற்றி) denote?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Melody, Face", "B": "Song, Forehead", "C": "Sound, Headband", "D": "Renown/Fame, Treetop/Summit (புகழ், உச்சி)"}, "explanation": "'Isai' denotes glory/fame, and 'Netri' denotes the uppermost crown or summit of the tree."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 134, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 134", "url": null, "sourc