{"id": "9th-u8-q151", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "comprehension", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u8", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u8-l6", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "kalaichol-matching-literary", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "ஆங்கிலக் கலைச்சொற்களையும் அவற்றுக்குரிய தமிழ்ச் சொற்களையும் பொருத்துக:\n1. Free verse - அ. உருவக அணி\n2. Metaphor - ஆ. உவமையணி\n3. Simile - இ. புதுக்கவிதை\n4. Symbolism - ஈ. குறியீட்டியல்", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1-அ, 2-ஆ, 3-இ, 4-ஈ", "B": "1-ஆ, 2-அ, 3-ஈ, 4-இ", "C": "1-இ, 2-அ, 3-ஆ, 4-ஈ", "D": "1-ஈ, 2-இ, 3-அ, 4-ஆ"}, "explanation": "சரியான பொருத்தம்: 1. Free verse - புதுக்கவிதை (இ), 2. Metaphor - உருவக அணி (அ), 3. Simile - உவமையணி (ஆ), 4. Symbolism - குறியீட்டியல் (ஈ). எனவே 1-இ, 2-அ, 3-ஆ, 4-ஈ."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the literary English terms with their standard Tamil counterparts:\n1. Free verse - a. Metaphor (உருவக அணி)\n2. Metaphor - b. Simile (உவமையணி)\n3. Simile - c. Free verse (புதுக்கவிதை)\n4. Symbolism - d. Symbolism (குறியீட்டியல்)", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1-a, 2-b, 3-c, 4-d", "B": "1-b, 2-a, 3-d, 4-c", "C": "1-c, 2-a, 3-b, 4-d", "D": "1-d, 2-c, 3-a, 4-b"}, "explanation": "Correct matching: Free verse = புதுக்கவிதை, Metaphor = உருவக அணி, Simile = உவமையணி, Symbolism = குறியீட்டியல்."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": 