{"id": "9th-u9-q153", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "comprehension", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u9", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u9-l7", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "thirukkural-marunthena-vendavaam", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"மருந்தென வேண்டாவாம் யாக்கைக்கு அருந்தியது / அற்றது போற்றி உணின்\" - இக்குறள் மனித உடலுக்கு மருந்தே தேவையில்லை என்று எப்போது கூறுகிறது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "முன் உண்ட உணவு செரித்ததை (சீரணமானதை) அறிந்து, அதன் பின்னர் அளவோடு உண்பானானால்", "B": "தினமும் உடற்பயிற்சி செய்தால்", "C": "மூலிகைகளை மட்டுமே உண்டால்", "D": "உணவைத் தவிர்த்து விரதம் இருந்தால்"}, "explanation": "முன் உண்ட உணவு செரித்த தன்மையை நன்றாக ஆராய்ந்து அறிந்து, அதன் பின்னரே அடுத்த வேளை உணவை உண்பவனுக்கு அவன் உடலுக்கு எந்த மருந்தும் தேவையில்லை என்று வள்ளுவர் 'மருந்து' அதிகாரத்தில் தெளிவுபடுத்துகிறார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "According to the Kural 'Marunthena vendaavaam yaakkaikku...', when does the physical body require no medicinal treatment?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "When one verifies that previously ingested food has digested fully before eating again with moderation", "B": "When one exercises rigorously daily", "C": "When one consumes solely herbal remedies", "D": "When one fasts perpetually"}, "explanation": "Eating only after the previous meal has fully digested eliminates the need for medicine."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 195, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 195", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_9", "thirukkural", "marunthu"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u9-q154", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "application", "level": "application", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u9", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u9-l7", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "thirukkural-makkalae-polvar-kayavar", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"மக்களே போல்வர் கயவர் அவரன்ன / ஒப்பாரியாம் கண்ட தில்\" - இக்குறட்பாவில் அமைந்துள்ள அணி யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "உருவக அணி", "B": "உவமை அணி ('போல்வர்', 'அன்ன' ஆகிய உவம உருபுகள் வந்துள்ளன)", "C": "வேற்றுமை அணி", "D": "சொல் பின்வருநிலையணி"}, "explanation": "கயவர்கள் தோற்றத்தில் நன்மக்களைப் போன்றே காணப்படுவர்; இவ்விருவரிடையே உள்ள புறத்தோற்ற ஒற்றுமை போன்ற ஒன்றை வேறு எங்கும் காண முடியாது என 'போல்வர்', 'அன்ன' ஆகிய உவம உருபுகள் வெளிப்படையாக வந்துள்ளதால் இது 'உவமை அணி' ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What rhetorical figure of speech is embedded in: 'Makkalae polvar kayavar avaranna / oppaariyaam kanda thil'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Metaphor", "B": "Uvamai Ani (Simile - utilizing explicit markers 'polvar' and 'anna')", "C": "Vaetrumai Ani", "D": "Sol Pinvarunilai Ani"}, "explanation": "Explicit comparative particles ('polvar', 'anna') make this Uvamai Ani."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 196, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 196", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_9", "thirukkural", "uvamai_ani_kural"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u9-q155", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "application", "level": "application", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u9", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u9-l7", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "thirukkural-inmaiyin-innaathathu", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"இன்மையின் இன்னாதது யாதெனின் இன்மையின் / இன்மையே இன்னா தது\" - இக்குறட்பாவில் பயின்றுவந்துள்ள அணி எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "வேற்றுமை அணி", "B": "உவமை அணி", "C": "சொற்பொருள் பின்வருநிலையணி ('இன்மை', 'இன்னாதது' ஆகிய சொற்கள் ஒரே பொருளில் திரும்பத் திரும்ப வந்துள்ளன)", "D": "வஞ்சப்புகழ்ச்சி அணி"}, "explanation": "'இன்மை' (வறுமை) மற்றும் 'இன்னாதது' (துன்பமானது) என்னும் சொற்கள் குறளில் பலமுறை வந்து அதே பொருளைத் தருவதால் இது 'சொற்பொருள் பின்வருநிலையணி' ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In the Kural: 'Inmaiyin innaathathu yaathenin inmaiyin / inmaiyae innaa thathu', which figure of speech is featured?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Vaetrumai Ani", "B": "Uvamai Ani", "C": "Sorporul Pinvarunilai Ani ('Inmai' [poverty] and 'Innaathathu' [sorrowful] recur retaining identical meanings)", "D": "Vanjappugazhchi Ani"}, "explanation": "Repetition of 'Inmai' and 'Innaathathu' with identical meanings constitutes Sorporul Pinvarunilai Ani."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalv