{"id": "9th-rev-q039", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "knowledge", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u8", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u8-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "yaappu-maamun-naer-thalai-pyq", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "[TNPSC PYQ] யாப்பிலக்கணத்தில் நிலைமொழியின் மாமுன் (தேமா, புளிமா) வருமொழியின் நேர் அசை வருவது எவ்வகைத் தளை எனப்படும்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "நிரையொன்றாசிரியத்தளை", "B": "இயற்சீர் வெண்டளை", "C": "நேரொன்றாசிரியத்தளை (மாமுன் நேர்)", "D": "வெண்சீர் வெண்டளை"}, "explanation": "ஆசிரிய உரிச்சீரின் ஈற்றசை நேராக இருக்கும்போது (மாமுன்) வருமொழியின் முதல் அசை நேர் அசையாக ஒன்றிவருவது 'நேரொன்றாசிரியத்தளை' எனப்படும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "[TNPSC PYQ] When a preceding Maachir foot is followed by an initial Ner syllable in the succeeding foot, which Thalai is formed?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Niraiyondraasiriyathalai", "B": "Iyarchir Vendhalai", "C": "Naerondraasiriyathalai (மாமுன் நேர்)", "D": "Venchir Vendhalai"}, "explanation": "Maamun Ner forms Naerondraasiriyathalai."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 165, "chapter": null, "sect