{"id": "9th-rev-q040", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "knowledge", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u8", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u8-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "yaappu-kaaymun-naer-thalai-pyq", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "[TNPSC PYQ] யாப்பிலக்கணத்தில் காய்முன் நேர் அசை வருவது எவ்வகைத் தளை ஆகும்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "கலித்தளை", "B": "ஒன்றிய வஞ்சித்தளை", "C": "நேரொன்றாசிரியத்தளை", "D": "வெண்சீர் வெண்டளை (காய்முன் நேர்)"}, "explanation": "வெண்பாவுக்குரிய காய்ச்சீர்களின் முன் (தேமாங்காய், புளிமாங்காய், கூவிளங்காய், கருவிளங்காய்) வருமொழியின் நேர் அசை வருவது 'வெண்சீர் வெண்டளை' எனப்படும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "[TNPSC PYQ] In prosodic linkage, when a Kaaychir foot is followed by an initial Ner syllable, what Thalai is formed?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Kalithalai", "B": "Ondriya Vanjithalai", "C": "Naerondraasiriyathalai", "D": "Venchir Vendhalai (காய்முன் நேர்)"}, "explanation": "Kaaymun Ner strictly forms Venchir Vendhalai."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 165, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 16