{"id": "9th-rev-q045", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "application", "level": "application", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u9", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u9-l5", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ani-insol-vilainilam-uruvagam-pyq", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "[TNPSC PYQ] \"இன்சொல் விலைநிலமா ஈதலே வித்தாக / வன்சொற் களைகட்டு வாய்மை எருவட்டி...\" - இப்பாடலில் பயின்றுவந்துள்ள அணி எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "உருவக அணி (Metaphor)", "B": "உவமை அணி", "C": "வேற்றுமை அணி", "D": "இல் பொருள் உவமையணி"}, "explanation": "இனிய சொல்லை நிலமாகவும், ஈகையை விதையாகவும், வன்சொல்லைக் களையாகவும், வாய்மையை எருவாகவும் வேறுபாடின்றி ஒன்றென உருவகம் செய்துள்ளதால் இது 'உருவக அணி' ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "[TNPSC PYQ] In the moral verse 'Insol vilainilamaa eethalae viththaaga...', what primary figure is constructed?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Uruvaga Ani (உருவக அணி - Metaphor)", "B": "Uvamai Ani", "C": "Vaetrumai Ani", "D": "Ilporul Uvamai Ani"}, "explanation": "Ethical virtues are metaphorized as an agricultural field."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 189, "chapter": null, "section": null