{"id": "9th-rev-q052", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "comprehension", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u9", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u9-l7", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "thirukkural-kudiseyalvagai-aalvinai-pyq", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "[TNPSC PYQ] \"ஆள்வினையும் ஆன்ற அறிவும் எனஇரண்டின் / நீள்வினையால் நீளும் குடி\" - இதில் 'ஆள்வினை' என்பதன் பொருள் யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "ஆட்சி செய்யும் முறை", "B": "ஆட்களை வேலை வாங்குதல்", "C": "விதியை நம்பியிருத்தல்", "D": "விடாமுயற்சி (இடைவிடாத கடும் உழைப்பு)"}, "explanation": "'ஆள்வினை' என்பது விடாமுயற்சியையும் கடின உழைப்பையும் குறிக்கும் சொல்லாகும். விடாமுயற்சியும் முதிர்ந்த அறிவுமே ஒருவனின் குடிப்பெருமையை உயர்த்தும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "[TNPSC PYQ] In the Kural couplet from Kudiseyalvagai, what is the meaning of the term 'Aalvinai' (ஆள்வினை)?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Governance method", "B": "Supervising laborers", "C": "Relying on fate", "D": "Unyielding perseverance / Diligent hard work (விடாமுயற்சி)"}, "explanation": "'Aalvinai' means unrelenting perseverance."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025",