{"id": "9th-rev-q055", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "knowledge", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u8", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u8-l6", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "kalaichol-free-verse-cultural-boundaries-pyq", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "[TNPSC PYQ] கலைச்சொற்கள்: 'Free verse' மற்றும் 'Cultural boundaries' ஆகியவற்றிற்கு இணையான தமிழ்த் தொடர்கள் எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "மரபுக்கவிதை மற்றும் இயற்கை எல்லைகள்", "B": "நாடகக்கவிதை மற்றும் அரசியல் எல்லைகள்", "C": "புதுக்கவிதை மற்றும் பண்பாட்டு எல்லைகள்", "D": "கட்டுரை மற்றும் நில எல்லைகள்"}, "explanation": "Free verse = புதுக்கவிதை; Cultural boundaries = பண்பாட்டு எல்லைகள்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "[TNPSC PYQ] Identify the standard Tamil terms for 'Free verse' and 'Cultural boundaries':", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Traditional poetry and Natural boundaries", "B": "Dramatic verse and Political boundaries", "C": "Puthukkavithai and Panpaattu ellaigal (புதுக்கவிதை மற்றும் பண்பாட்டு எல்லைகள்)", "D": "Essay and Territorial borders"}, "explanation": "'Free verse' is புதுக்கவிதை; 'Cultural boundaries' is பண்பாட்டு எல்லைகள்."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9