{"id": "10th-u1-q079", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_1", "lesson_id": "irattura_mozhithal", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "poem_lines", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"முத்தமிழ் துய்ப்பதால் முச்சங்கம் கண்டதால் \nமெத்த வணிகலமும் மேவலால்...\" - இப்பாடலில் பயின்று வந்துள்ள அடி எதுகை எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "முத்தமிழ் - வணிகலமும்", "B": "முச்சங்கம் - மேவலால்", "C": "முத்தமிழ் - மெத்த", "D": "துய்ப்பதால் - கண்டதால்"}, "explanation": "முதல் அடியில் \"முத்தமிழ்\", இரண்டாம் அடியில் \"மெத்த\" - இரண்டெழுத்துகள் ஒன்றி (த்) வந்தமையால் இது அடி எதுகை ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Identify the base rhyme (Adi Ethukai) in the opening lines of Thamizhazhaganar’s poem:", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Muthamizh - Vanigalamum", "B": "Muchangam - Mevalaal", "C": "Muthamizh - Metha", "D": "Thuippathaal - Kandathaal"}, "explanation": "In line 1 \"Muthamizh\" and line 2 \"Metha\", the second letters match (\"th\"), constituting Adi Ethukai."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 9, "chapter": null, "section": null, "referen