{"id": "10th-u1-q108", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_1", "lesson_id": "urai_nadaiyin_aninangal", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "techniques_matching", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பொருத்துக (உரைநடை உத்திகள் - ஆங்கில இணைச்சொல்): \nஅ) இணை ஒப்பு - 1) Oxymoron \nஆ) சொல் முரண் - 2) Antithesis \nஇ) எதிரிணை இயைபு - 3) Climax \nஈ) உச்சநிலை - 4) Analogy", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "அ-1, ஆ-2, இ-3, ஈ-4", "B": "அ-2, ஆ-3, இ-4, ஈ-1", "C": "அ-3, ஆ-4, இ-1, ஈ-2", "D": "அ-4, ஆ-1, இ-2, ஈ-3"}, "explanation": "இணை ஒப்பு = Analogy; சொல் முரண் = Oxymoron; எதிரிணை இயைபு = Antithesis; உச்சநிலை = Climax."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match prose techniques with English equivalents:\na) Inai Oppu - 4) Analogy\nb) Sol Murann - 1) Oxymoron\nc) Ethirinai Iyaibu - 2) Antithesis\nd) Uchanilai - 3) Climax", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "a-1, b-2, c-3, d-4", "B": "a-2, b-3, c-4, d-1", "C": "a-3, b-4, c-1, d-2", "D": "a-4, b-1, c-2, d-3"}, "explanation": "Inai Oppu is Analogy; Sol Murann is Oxymoron; Ethirinai Iyaibu is Antithesis; Uchanilai is Climax."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year