{"id": "10th-u1-q140", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_1", "lesson_id": "eluthu_sol", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "pothumozhi_examples", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தனிமொழியாகவும் தொடர்மொழியாகவும் பொருள்தரும் \"தாமரை\" என்னும் சொல்லைப் பிரித்தால் தரும் பொருள் யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "தாமரைக் குளம்", "B": "தாவுகின்ற குதிரை", "C": "தாமதமான நரை", "D": "தாவுகின்ற மான் (தா + மரை)"}, "explanation": "தாமரை தனித்து நின்று மலரைக் குறிக்கும்; தா + மரை எனப் பிரியும் போது \"தாவுகின்ற மான்\" எனப் பொருள் தந்து பொதுமொழியாகும் (மரை = மான்)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "When the Pothumozhi \"Thaamarai\" is split into \"Thaa + Marai\", what meaning does it convey?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Lotus pond", "B": "Jumping horse", "C": "Delayed gray hair", "D": "Leaping deer (Thaa + Marai; Marai = deer)"}, "explanation": "\"Thaa + Marai\" parses as \"leaping/bounding deer\", as Marai refers to deer in classical Tamil."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 17, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit