{"id": "10th-u6-q135", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_6", "lesson_id": "agapporul_ilakkanam", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "paalai_pozhuthu", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பாலைத் திணைக்குரிய பெரும் பொழுதுகள் மற்றும் சிறு பொழுது முறையே எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "கார், கூதிர்; மாலை", "B": "ஆறு பெரும்பொழுதுகளும்; வைகறை", "C": "இளவேனில், முதுவேனில், பின்பனி; சிறுபொழுது: நண்பகல் (கடும் வெயில் நேரம்)", "D": "முன்பனி; யாமம்"}, "explanation": "பாலை நிலத்திற்குரிய பெரும்பொழுதுகள்: இளவேனில், முதுவேனில், பின்பனி; சிறுபொழுது: உச்சி வெயில் சுட்டெரிக்கும் \"நண்பகல்\" ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What are the macro-seasons and micro-time allotted to the arid Paalai wasteland?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Kaar, Koothir; Maalai", "B": "All six seasons; Vaikarai", "C": "Ilavenil, Muthuvenil, Pinpani; Sirupozhuthu: Nanpagal (Scorching Midday)", "D": "Munpani; Yaamam"}, "explanation": "Paalai is ruled by summer/dewy heat and blazing midday (Nanpagal)."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 142, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 6, Page 142", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["அகப்பொருள் இலக்கணம்", "பாலைப் பொழுது", "நண்பகல்"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "10th-u6-q136", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_6", "lesson_id": "agapporul_ilakkanam", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "match_sirupozhuthu_lands", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "ஐந்திணைகளையும் அவற்றுக்குரிய சிறு பொழுதுகளையும் சரியாகப் பொருத்துக:\n(a) குறிஞ்சி - 1. மாலை\n(b) முல்லை - 2. நண்பகல்\n(c) மருதம் - 3. யாமம்\n(d) நெய்தல் - 4. வைகறை\n(e) பாலை - 5. எற்பாடு", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(a)-1, (b)-2, (c)-3, (d)-4, (e)-5", "B": "(a)-2, (b)-1, (c)-4, (d)-5, (e)-3", "C": "(a)-4, (b)-1, (c)-3, (d)-5, (e)-2", "D": "(a)-3, (b)-1, (c)-4, (d)-5, (e)-2"}, "explanation": "குறிஞ்சி = யாமம் (3); முல்லை = மாலை (1); மருதம் = வைகறை (4); நெய்தல் = எற்பாடு (5); பாலை = நண்பகல் (2). சரியான வரிசை: 3, 1, 4, 5, 2."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the 5 landscapes with their respective Sirupozhuthu micro-times:\n(a) Kurinji - 1. Maalai\n(b) Mullai - 2. Nanpagal\n(c) Marutham - 3. Yaamam\n(d) Neithal - 4. Vaikarai\n(e) Paalai - 5. Erpaadu", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(a)-1, (b)-2, (c)-3, (d)-4, (e)-5", "B": "(a)-2, (b)-1, (c)-4, (d)-5, (e)-3", "C": "(a)-4, (b)-1, (c)-3, (d)-5, (e)-2", "D": "(a)-3, (b)-1, (c)-4, (d)-5, (e)-2"}, "explanation": "The correct matching sequence is 3, 1, 4, 5, 2."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 142, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 6, Page 142", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["அகப்பொருள் இலக்கணம்", "பொருத்துக", "திணைகளும் சிறுபொழுதுகளும்"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "10th-u6-q137", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_6", "lesson_id": "agapporul_ilakkanam", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "paalai_terrain_origin", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தொல்காப்பியத்திலும் சங்க இலக்கியங்களிலும் \"பாலை\" என்பது தனியொரு நிலமன்று; எந்த இரு நிலங்கள் வறட்சியால் திரிந்து பாலை நிலமாக மாறும்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "முல்லையும் குறிஞ்சியும் முறைமையில் திரிந்து நல்லியல்பு இழந்து உருவாவது பாலை", "B": "மருதமும் நெய்தலும்", "C": "குறிஞ்சியும் மருதமும்", "D": "கடலும் காடும்"}, "explanation": "சிலப்பதிகார வரிகள்: \"முல்லையும் குறிஞ்சியும் முறைமையில் திரிந்து நல்லியல்பு இழந்து நடுங்குதுயர் உறுத்துப் பாலை என்பதோர் படிவம் கொள்ளும்\"."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "According to classical Tamil ecological theory, Paalai is formed when which two verdant landscapes lose their natural lushness due to drought?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Mullai (Forests) and Kurinji (Mountains) withered by severe drought and heat", "B": "Marutham and Neithal", "C": "Kurinji and Marutham", "D": "Ocean and mangrove"}, "explanation": "Kurinji and Mullai parched by intense sun transform into Paalai."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 141, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 6, Page 141", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["அகப்பொருள் இலக்கணம்", "பாலை உருவாக்கம்", "முல்லையும் குறிஞ்சியும்"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "10th-u6-q138", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_6", "lesson_id": "agapporul_ilakkanam", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "anbin_ainthinai_count", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "அகத்திணைகள் மொத்தம் ஏழு வகைப்படும் (கைக்கிளை, ஐந்திணை, பெருந்திணை); அவற்றுள் \"அன்பின் ஐந்திணை\" என அழைக்கப்படுபவை எத்தனை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "மூன்று திணைகள்", "B": "ஐந்து திணைகள் (குறிஞ்சி, முல்லை, மருதம், நெய்தல், பாலை)", "C": "ஏழு திணைகள்", "D": "பன்னிரண்டு திணைகள்"}, "explanation": "தலைவன் தலைவிக்கு இடையே நிகழும் ஒத்த தூய காதலைப் பாடும் குறிஞ்சி, முல்லை, மருதம், நெய்தல், பாலை ஆகிய ஐந்தும் \"அன்பின் ஐந்திணைகள்\" எனப்படுகின்றன."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Out of the seven broad Agatthinais, how many are venerated as \"Anbin Ainthinai\" (The Five Sublime Landscapes of Mutual Love)?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Three landscapes", "B": "Five landscapes (Kurinji, Mullai, Marutham, Neithal, Paalai)", "C": "Seven landscapes", "D": "Twelve landscapes"}, "explanation": "The five balanced mutual love landscapes form Anbin Ainthinai."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_yea