{"id": "10th-u6-q149", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_6", "lesson_id": "karupporul_uripporul", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "neithal_paalai_uripporul", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "நெய்தல் நிலத்திற்கும் பாலை நிலத்திற்கும் உரிய உரிப்பொருள்கள் முறையே எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "இரங்கலும் இரங்கல் நிமித்தமும் (நெய்தல்) மற்றும் பிரிதலும் பிரிதல் நிமித்தமும் (பாலை)", "B": "ஊடலும் இருத்தலும்", "C": "புணர்தலும் ஊடலும்", "D": "இருத்தலும் புணர்தலும்"}, "explanation": "நெய்தலின் உரிப்பொருள் = இரங்கல் (தலைவன் கடலுக்குச் சென்றதால் தலைவி வருந்துதல்); பாலையின் உரிப்பொருள் = பிரிதல் (பொருள் தேடவோ போருக்கோ தலைவன் பிரிந்து செல்லுதல்)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What are the designated Uripporul sentiments for Neithal (Coast) and Paalai (Arid Waste) respectively?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Irangal / Anxious pining (Neithal) and Pirithal / Painful separation (Paalai)", "B": "Oodal and Irutthal", "C": "Punaruthal and Oodal", "D": "Irutthal and Punaruthal"}, "explanation": "Neithal embodies anxious pining (Irangal) and Paalai represents harsh separation (Pirithal)."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 143, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 6, Page 143", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["அகப்பொருள் இலக்கணம்", "உரிப்பொருள்", "இரங்கல் பிரிதல்"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "10th-u6-q150", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_6", "lesson_id": "karupporul_uripporul", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "match_five_uripporul", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "ஐந்திணைகளையும் அவற்றுக்குரிய உரிப்பொருள்களையும் சரியாகப் பொருத்துக:\n(a) குறிஞ்சி - 1. இருத்தல்\n(b) முல்லை - 2. புணர்தல்\n(c) மருதம் - 3. இரங்கல்\n(d) நெய்தல் - 4. ஊடல்\n(e) பாலை - 5. பிரிதல்", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(a)-1, (b)-2, (c)-3, (d)-4, (e)-5", "B": "(a)-2, (b)-1, (c)-4, (d)-3, (e)-5", "C": "(a)-2, (b)-1, (c)-3, (d)-4, (e)-5", "D": "(a)-5, (b)-4, (c)-3, (d)-2, (e)-1"}, "explanation": "குறிஞ்சி = புணர்தல் (2); முல்லை = இருத்தல் (1); மருதம் = ஊடல் (4); நெய்தல் = இரங்கல் (3); பாலை = பிரிதல் (5). சரியான வரிசை: 2, 1, 4, 3, 5."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the 5 landscapes with their respective Uripporul love-phases:\n(a) Kurinji - 1. Irutthal (Waiting)\n(b) Mullai - 2. Punaruthal (Union)\n(c) Marutham - 3. Irangal (Pining)\n(d) Neithal - 4. Oodal (Sulking)\n(e) Paalai - 5. Pirithal (Separation)", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(a)-1, (b)-2, (c)-3, (d)-4, (e)-5", "B": "(a)-2, (b)-1, (c)-4, (d)-3, (e)-5", "C": "(a)-2, (b)-1, (c)-3, (d)-4, (e)-5", "D": "(a)-5, (b)-4, (c)-3, (d)-2, (e)-1"}, "explanation": "The matching sequence is 2, 1, 4, 3, 5."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 143, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 6, Page 143", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["அகப்பொருள் இலக்கணம்", "பொருத்துக", "திணைகளும் உரிப்பொருள்களும்"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
