{"id": "10th-u7-q144", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "purapporul_ilakkanam", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "nochi_and_uzhignai", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தன் கோட்டையைக் காக்க உள்ளிருந்து போரிடுதல் \"நொச்சித் திணை\" எனில், பகைவனின் கோட்டையைக் கைப்பற்ற மதிலை வளைத்து முற்றுகையிடுதல் எத்திணை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "தும்பைத் திணை", "B": "பாடாண் திணை", "C": "வாகைத் திணை", "D": "உழிஞைத் திணை"}, "explanation": "கோட்டையைக் காக்க உள்ளிருந்து போரிடுதல் = நொச்சி; கோட்டையைக் கைப்பற்ற மதிலைச் சுற்றி வளைத்தல் = உழிஞைத் திணை (உழிஞைப் பூவைச் சூடுவர்)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "If defending the fort from within is Nochi Thinai, what is laying siege to the enemy fortress called?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Thumbai Thinai", "B": "Paadaan Thinai", "C": "Vaagai Thinai", "D": "Uzhignai Thinai (Siege warfare)"}, "explanation": "Storming and sieging a fortress is Uzhignai Thinai."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 168, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 7, Page 168", "url