{"id": "10th-u8-q149", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_8", "lesson_id": "paa_vagai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "alagituthal_piravipperungadal", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"பிறவிப் பெருங்கடல் நீந்துவர் நீந்தார் / இறைவனடி சேரா தார்\" - இக்குறட்பாவின் ஈற்றுச்சீரான \"தார்\" என்பதன் வாய்பாடு யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "நாள் (நேரசை - தனிநெடில் ஒற்று)", "B": "மலர் (நிரையசை)", "C": "காசு (நேர்பு)", "D": "பிறப்பு (நிரைபு)"}, "explanation": "அலகிடுதல் விளக்கம்: தார் = தா (நெடில்) + ர் (ஒற்று) = நேரசை = நாள் என்னும் வாய்பாடு."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In the Kural ending with \"Dhaar\", what is the metrical formula of this terminal foot?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Naal (Nerasai - long vowel + consonant)", "B": "Malar (Niraiyasai)", "C": "Kaasu (Nerpu)", "D": "Pirappu (Niraipu)"}, "explanation": "Dhaar is a long syllable with consonant, concluding with the Naal formula."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 189, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 8, Page 189", "url": null, "sou