{"id": "10th-u9-q157", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_9", "lesson_id": "thirukkural", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "statement_analysis_kural", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "திருக்குறள் பற்றிய கீழ்க்காணும் கூற்றுகளை ஆராய்க:\n1. மெய்யுணர்தல் அதிகாரத்தில் மெய்ப்பொருள் காண்பதே அறிவு எனக் கூறப்பட்டுள்ளது.\n2. ஆள்வினையுடைமை அதிகாரத்தில் முயற்சியின் மேன்மை போற்றப்படுகிறது.\n3. வள்ளுவர் ஒழுக்கத்தை விட செல்வமே உயர்ந்தது என்று கூறுகிறார்.\nஇவற்றுள் தவறான கூற்று எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "3 மட்டும் (தவறு: ஒழுக்கமே உயிரினும் மேலானது)", "B": "1 மட்டும்", "C": "2 மட்டும்", "D": "1 மற்றும் 2"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் ஆய்வு: வள்ளுவர் ஒழுக்கத்தை உயிரினும் மேலானதாகக் கூறுகிறார்; செல்வம் மேலானது எனக் கூறவில்லை. எனவே கூற்று 3 தவறானது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Analyze statements on Kural: 1. Meiyunarthal defines seeing reality as wisdom. 2. Aalvinaiyudaimai praises perseverance. 3. Valluvar ranks wealth above character. Which is false?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "3 only (False: character is valued higher than life itself)", "B": "1 only", "C": "2 only", "D": "1 and 2"}, "explanation": "Statement 3 is false as Valluvar ranks moral character above life itself."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 71, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 9, Page 71", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["திருக்குறள்", "கூற்று ஆய்வு", "தவறான கூற்று"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "10th-u9-q158", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_9", "lesson_id": "thirukkural", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "tnpsc_pyq_epporul_ani", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "[TNPSC முந்தைய ஆண்டு வினா] \"எப்பொருள் யார்யார்வாய்க் கேட்பினும் அப்பொருள் / மெய்ப்பொருள் காண்ப தறிவு\" - இக்குறளில் அமைந்துள்ள முதன்மைப் பொருள் யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "கேட்டதை உடனே நம்புதல்", "B": "யார் கூறினாலும் அதன் மெய்ம்மையை ஆராய்ந்து உண்மையை அறிதலே அறிவுடைமை", "C": "பெரியோர் சொல்வதை மட்டும் கேட்பது", "D": "யாரையும் நம்பாமல் இருப்பது"}, "explanation": "TNPSC வினா விளக்கம்: யார் எதைச் சொன்னாலும் அதை அப்படியே ஏற்காமல் அதன் உண்மைத் தன்மையை ஆராய்ந்து காண்பதே பகுத்தறிவு ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "[TNPSC PYQ] What is the core philosophical tenet of \"Epporul yaaryaarvaaik ketpinum...\"?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Believing instantly", "B": "Discerning true essence regardless of who conveys it constitutes true wisdom", "C": "Listening only to elders", "D": "Distrusting everyone"}, "explanation": "Discerning true reality irrespective of the speaker represents genuine wisdom."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 71, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 9, Page 71", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["TNPSC PYQ", "எப்பொருள் யார்யார்வாய்", "பகுத்தறிவு"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "10th-u9-q159", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_9", "lesson_id": "thirukkural", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "matching_kural_themes", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பொருத்துக (குறளும் அதன் மையக் கருத்தும்):\nஅ) ஆள்வினையுடைமை - 1. உயிரினும் மேலானது\nஆ) ஒழுக்கமுடைமை - 2. களை பிடுங்குவதற்கு சமம்\nஇ) கொடுங்கோன்மை - 3. மெய்வருத்தக் கூலி தரும் முயற்சி\nஈ) கண்ணோட்டம் - 4. பண்ணொத்த இரக்கப் பார்வை", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "அ-1, ஆ-2, இ-3, ஈ-4", "B": "அ-2, ஆ-3, இ-4, ஈ-1", "C": "அ-3, ஆ-1, இ-2, ஈ-4", "D": "அ-4, ஆ-1, இ-2, ஈ-3"}, "explanation": "சரியான பொருத்தம்: ஆள்வினையுடைமை - முயற்சி; ஒழுக்கமுடைமை - உயிரினும் மேலானது; கொடுங்கோன்மை - களை பிடுங்குதல்; கண்ணோட்டம் - இரக்கப் பார்வை."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match Kural themes: a) Perseverance - 1. Precious than life b) Character - 2. Weeding crops c) Tyranny justice - 3. Hard-earned effort reward d) Compassion - 4. Melodious mercy.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "a-1, b-2, c-3, d-4", "B": "a-2, b-3, c-4, d-1", "C": "a-3, b-1, c-2, d-4", "D": "a-4, b-3, c-2, d-1"}, "explanation": "Correct match is a-3, b-1, c-2, d-4."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 143, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 9, Page 143", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["திருக்குறள்", "பொருத்துக", "அதிகாரக் கருத்துகள்"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "10th-u9-q160", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_9", "lesson_id": "thirukkural", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "grammar_split_oppuravu", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"ஒப்புரவு\" என்னும் சொல்லின் சரியான பொருள் யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "ஒப்பந்தம் செய்தல்", "B": "ஒத்துப் போகுதல்", "C": "ஒப்பனை செய்தல்", "D": "உலக நடையறிந்து எல்லோருக்கும் பொதுவாக உதவி வாழ்தல் (ஊருக்கு உதவுதல்)"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் விளக்கம்: உலக ஒழுக்கத்தை அறிந்து, தகுதியுடையோருக்கு உதவி செய்யும் நற்பண்பே \"ஒப்புரவு\" எனப்படும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What is the classical ethical definition of \"Oppuravu\"?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Contract", "B": "Compromise", "C": "Makeup", "D": "Living in benevolent harmony by aiding society in tune with world order"}, "explanation": "Oppuravu signifies altruistic social beneficence."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 210, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 9, Page 210", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false