{"id": "10th-u9-q161", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_9", "lesson_id": "thirukkural", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "thirukkural_transcendental_glory", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "திருக்குறள் எந்த ஒரு குறிப்பிட்ட சாதி, மதம், இனம், மொழி எல்லைக்குள்ளும் சிக்காமல் திகழ்வதால் அது எவ்வாறு அழைக்கப்படுகிறது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "உலகப் பொதுமறை", "B": "தமிழ் வேதம் மட்டுமே", "C": "பக்தி நூல்", "D": "வரலாற்று நூல்"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் குறிப்பு: எந்த மதத்தின் அடையாளமும் இன்றி மனித குலம் முழுமைக்குமான வாழ்வியல் நெறிகளைக் கூறுவதால் திருக்குறள் \"உலகப் பொதுமறை\" எனப் போற்றப்படுகிறது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Why is Thirukkural hailed as the \"Universal Scripture\" (Ulaga Podhumarai)?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Because it transcends boundaries of caste, creed, religion, language, and era for all humankind", "B": "It is only a Tamil scripture", "C": "It is a sectarian prayer book", "D": "It is a history chronicle"}, "explanation": "Because its ethical maxims apply universally to all humankind across time."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 211, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 9, Page 211", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["திருக்குறள்", "உலகப் பொதுமறை", "பெருமை"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "10th-u9-q162", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_9", "lesson_id": "thirukkural", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "tnpsc_pyq_periyaarai_thunai", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "[TNPSC முந்தைய ஆண்டு வினா] \"இடிப்பாரை இல்லாத ஏமரா மன்னன் / கெடுப்பார் இலானும் கெடும்\" - இதில் \"இடிப்பாரை\" என்பதன் பொருள் யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "சுவரை இடிப்பவர்", "B": "குற்றம் கண்டவிடத்துத் தடுத்துக் கண்டித்து நல்வழிப்படுத்தும் சான்றோர் / அமைச்சர்கள்", "C": "பகைவர்கள்", "D": "கோவில் பூசாரிகள்"}, "explanation": "TNPSC வினா: அரசன் தவறு செய்யும் போது அவனைக் கடிந்துரைத்துத் திருத்தும் அறிவார்ந்த பெரியோரே \"இடிப்பார்\" எனப்படுவர்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "[TNPSC PYQ] In \"Idippaarai illatha emara mannan...\", what does \"Idippaarai\" signify?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Demolishers", "B": "Wise counselors/elders who fearlessly rebuke errors to steer a king on the right path", "C": "Enemies", "D": "Temple priests"}, "explanation": "Wise preceptors who fearlessly censure errors to guide a leader."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025"