{"id": "11th_tamil_u1_q064", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_1", "lesson_id": "poem_nannool_paayiram", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "paayiram_seven_names", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘முகவுரை, பதிகம், அணிந்துரை, புனைந்துரை, பாயிரம், புறவுரை, தந்துரை’ என பாயிரத்திற்குரிய பெயர்கள் எத்தனை என்று நன்னூல் கூறுகிறது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "ஐந்து", "B": "ஆறு", "C": "எட்டு", "D": "ஏழு (7 பெயர்கள்)"}, "explanation": "பாயிரத்திற்கு வழங்கப்படும் வேறு பெயர்கள் மொத்தம் ஏழு: 1. முகவுரை, 2. பதிகம், 3. அணிந்துரை, 4. புனைந்துரை, 5. பாயிரம், 6. புறவுரை, 7. தந்துரை."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "According to the grammatical tradition recorded in Nannool, how many alternative synonymic appellations exist for Paayiram?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Five", "B": "Six", "C": "Eight", "D": "Seven (7 names)"}, "explanation": "Seven classical synonyms exist: Mugavurai, Pathigam, Aninthurai, Punainthurai, Paayiram, Puravurai, and Thanthurai."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 6, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tam