{"id": "11th_tamil_u1_q073", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_1", "lesson_id": "poem_nannool_paayiram", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "who_makes_chirappuppaayiram", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "சிறப்புப்பாயிரத்தை இயற்றுவதற்கு உரிய தகுதி படைத்தவர்கள் யார் யார் என்று நன்னூல் குறிப்பிடுகிறது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "நூலாசிரியனின் ஆசிரியர், அவனோடு பயின்ற ஒருசாலை மாணாக்கன், அவன் மாணவன், நூலுக்கு உரை எழுதிய உரைநூலாசிரியர்", "B": "நாட்டின் அரசன் மட்டுமே", "C": "நூலாசிரியனே தன் சிறப்புப்பாயிரத்தைத் தானே எழுத வேண்டும்", "D": "அவ்வூரின் பொதுமக்கள் மட்டுமே"}, "explanation": "தன் பெருமையைத் தானே கூறலாகாது என்பதால், சிறப்புப்பாயிரத்தை ஆசிரியனின் ஆசிரியர், ஒருசாலை மாணாக்கன், மாணவன் அல்லது உரையாசிரியர் ஆகிய நால்வரே இயற்ற வேண்டும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "According to grammatical convention in Nannool, who is legitimately qualified to compose a Chirappuppaayiram?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "The author's revered teacher, a fellow classmate, a dedicated disciple, or the scholarly commentator", "B": "The ruling monarch alone", "C": "The author himself must boast his own praise", "D": "General townspeople only"}, "explanation": "An author must not self-aggrandize; hence his teacher, classmate, student, or commentator composes the specific preface."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 7, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 7", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 11", "Unit 1", "Grammar", "Rules"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "11th_tamil_u1_q075", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_1", "lesson_id": "poem_nannool_paayiram", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "pothupaayiram_details", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கீழ்க்கண்டவற்றுள் பொதுப்பாயிரத்தின் 5 கூறுகளில் இடம்பெறாத ஒன்று எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "ஆசிரியர் வரலாறு", "B": "கற்பிக்கும் முறைமை", "C": "நூல் அரங்கேற்றப்பட்ட நாட்டின் எல்லை", "D": "மாணவர் வரலாறு"}, "explanation": "எல்லை என்பது சிறப்புப்பாயிரத்திற்குரிய கூறாகும்; பொதுப்பாயிரத்தில் நூலின் இயல்பு, ஆசிரியர் இயல்பு, கற்பித்தல், மாணவர் இயல்பு, கற்கும் முறைமை ஆகிய ஐந்தே இடம்பெறும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which of the following does NOT belong to the 5 elements of Pothuppaayiram?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Nature of the teacher", "B": "Methodology of teaching", "C": "Geographical border of the country", "D": "Nature of the student"}, "explanation": "Territorial boundary (Ellai) is an attribute of Chirappuppaayiram, not Pothuppaayiram."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 6, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 6", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 11", "Unit 1", "Grammar", "Classification"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "11th_tamil_u1_q076", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_1", "lesson_id": "poem_nannool_paayiram", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "matching_preface_types", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பொருத்துக:\n(a) முகவுரை - 1. நூலில் சொல்லப்பட்ட பொருள் அல்லாதவற்றைத் தந்துரைத்தல்\n(b) பதிகம் - 2. நூலின் முகத்தில் வைக்கப்படுவது\n(c) அணிந்துரை - 3. நூலின் பெருமை விளங்குமாறு அழகுபெறப் புனைந்துரைப்பது\n(d) தந்துரை - 4. ஐந்து பொதுவும் பதினொரு சிறப்புமாகிய பல பொருள்களையும் தொகுத்துரைப்பது", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(a)-1, (b)-2, (c)-3, (d)-4", "B": "(a)-4, (b)-3, (c)-2, (d)-1", "C": "(a)-3, (b)-1, (c)-4, (d)-2", "D": "(a)-2, (b)-4, (c)-3, (d)-1"}, "explanation": "முகவுரை = முகத்தில் வைப்பது (2); பதிகம் = பொது 5, சிறப்பு 11 ஐத் தொகுத்துரைப்பது (4); அணிந்துரை = அழகுபெற உரைப்பது (3); தந்துரை = சொல்லப்படாதவற்றைத் தந்துரைப்பது (1). எனவே விடை D."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the classical preface terms with their definitions:\n(a) Mugavurai - 1. Supplying matter not directly in the text\n(b) Pathigam - 2. Placed at the face/threshold of text\n(c) Aninthurai - 3. Ornate eulogy praising the work\n(d) Thanthurai - 4. Summarizing the 5 general and 11 specific traits", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(a)-1, (b)-2, (c)-3, (d)-4", "B": "(a)-4, (b)-3, (c)-2, (d)-1", "C": "(a)-3, (b)-1, (c)-4, (d)-2", "D": "(a)-2, (b)-4, (c)-3, (d)-1"}, "explanation": "Mugavurai = threshold; Pathigam = systematic summary of 5+11; Aninthurai = aesthetic praise; Thanthurai = complementary commentary."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 6, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 6", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 11", "Unit 1", "Grammar", "Matching Terms"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "11th_tamil_u1_q077", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_1", "lesson_id": "poem_nannool_paayiram", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "chirappu_ellai_meaning", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "சிறப்புப்பாயிரத்தில் ‘எல்லை’ என்பது எதனைக் குறிக்கிறது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "நூல் வழங்கும் நிலப்பரப்பின் எல்லை (எ.கா. வடவேங்கடம் தென்குமரி)", "B": "நூலில் உள்ள பக்கங்களின் எல்லை", "C": "நூல் விற்கப்படும் விலையின் எல்லை", "D": "நூலை வாங்கும் வாசகர்களின் வயது எல்லை"}, "explanation": "எல்லை என்பது அந்நூல் எந்தெந்த நிலப்பரப்பில் வாழும் மக்களுக்காகப் பேசுகிறது என்ற புவியியல் நிலப்பரப்பின் எல்லையைக் குறிக்கும் (எ.கா: தமிழ்கூறும் நல்லுலகம்)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In Chirappuppaayiram, what does the term 'Ellai' (Border/Extent) denote?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Geographical territorial boundary where the language/text prevails", "B": "Total page boundary of the manuscript", "C": "Price boundary of book sales", "D": "Age limit boundary of readers"}, "explanation": "'Ellai' specifies the territorial boundaries of the linguistic realm (e.g., Venkatam to Kumari)."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services C