{"id": "11th_tamil_u1_q086", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_1", "lesson_id": "poem_nannool_paayiram", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "teacher_simile_nilam", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘அகழ்வாரைத் தாங்கும் நிலம்போலத் தன்பால் கற்போரின் பொறுமையின்மையை ஆற்றிப் பயன் தருபவர்’ - இந்நன்னூல் விளக்கம் எந்த உவமையைக் குறிக்கிறது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "மலை", "B": "நிலம்", "C": "நிறைகோல்", "D": "மலர்"}, "explanation": "தன்னைத் தோண்டுபவரையும் தாங்கும் நிலம் போல, மாணவர்களின் குறைகளையும் அறியாமையையும் பொறுத்துக் கொண்டு கல்வி வளம் தருவதால் நிலம் நல்லாசிரியருக்கு உவமையாயிற்று."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which archetype in Nannool symbolizes an instructor patiently bearing students' ignorance and flaws to bestow wisdom, like the earth bearing those who dig it?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Mountain", "B": "Earth (Nilam)", "C": "Balance Scales", "D": "Flower"}, "explanation": "Earth patiently bears those who excavate it; similarly, a noble teacher bears student limitations."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 8, "chapter": n