{"id": "11th_tamil_u2_q141", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "easy", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_2", "lesson_id": "grammar_punarchi_vithigal", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "udampadumei_definition", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "நிலைமொழியின் ஈற்றிலும் வருமொழியின் முதலிலும் உயிரெழுத்துகள் வரும்போது, அவற்றை இணைக்க இடையில் தோன்றும் மெய்யெழுத்து எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "உடம்படுமெய் (Glides: ய், வ்)", "B": "இடைநிலை", "C": "சாரியை", "D": "சுட்டெழுத்து"}, "explanation": "நிலைமொழியின் ஈற்றில் உயிரும் வருமொழியின் முதலில் உயிரும் வந்தால் இரண்டும் உடன்படாது (ஒன்றாக ஒலிக்காது); எனவே அவற்றை இணைக்க 'ய்' அல்லது 'வ்' என்னும் உடம்படுமெய் தோன்றும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "When vowels occur at both the end of the preceding word and the beginning of the succeeding word, which transitional linking consonant appears between them?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Udampadumei (Phonetic Glides: Y and V)", "B": "Medial marker (Idainilai)", "C": "Inflectional formative (Saariyai)", "D": "Demonstrative prefix"}, "explanation": "To bridge hiatus between two adjacent vowel sounds, transitional glides 'y' (ய்) or 'v' (வ்) appear as Udampadumei."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 36, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit 2, Page 36", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 11", "Unit 2", "Grammar", "Udampadumei"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "11th_tamil_u2_q142", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_2", "lesson_id": "grammar_punarchi_vithigal", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "nannool_sutra_glides", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘இ ஈ ஐ வழி யவ்வும் / ஏனை உயிர் வழி வவ்வும் / ஏமுன் இவ்விருமையும்...’ - இந்நன்னூல் நூற்பா எதனை விளக்குகிறது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "குற்றியலுகரப் புணர்ச்சி", "B": "உடம்படுமெய்ப் புணர்ச்சி விதிகள்", "C": "வேற்றுமைப் புணர்ச்சி", "D": "திசைப் பெயர்ப் புணர்ச்சி"}, "explanation": "இ, ஈ, ஐ ஈறுகளுக்குப் பின் 'ய'கரமும்; ஏனை உயிர்களுக்குப் பின் 'வ'கரமும்; 'ஏ'காரத்திற்குப் பின் 'ய, வ' இரண்டும் உடம்படுமெய்யாக வரும் என்பதை இந்நூற்பா விளக்குகிறது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What phonological sandhi rule does the Nannool sutra 'I, Ee, Ai vazhi yavvum / Eanai uyir vazhi vavvum / Ea-mun ivvirumaiyum...' formulate?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Kurriyallukaram elision rules", "B": "Udampadumei glide transition sandhi canons", "C": "Case marker inflection", "D": "Directional noun compounding"}, "explanation": "It defines the exact rules governing glide insertions: 'y' after i/ee/ai, 'v' after other vowels, and both after 'ea'."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher"