{"id": "11th_tamil_u4_q166", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_4", "lesson_id": "grammar_padaippaakka_uthigal", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "symbolism_crow", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "நவீனக் கவிதைகளில் ‘காக்கை’ அல்லது ‘காகம்’ எத்தகைய விளிம்புநிலை மக்களின் குறியீடாக ஆளப்படுகிறது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "செல்வந்தர்கள்", "B": "ஒதுக்கப்பட்ட எளிய மக்கள் / உழைக்கும் வர்க்கம்", "C": "அரசியல்வாதிகள்", "D": "மன்னர்கள்"}, "explanation": "குயிலை அழகுக்குரியதாகக் கொண்டாடும் உலகம் காக்கையை அதன் கருமைக்காக ஒதுக்குவது போல, சமூகத்தில் ஒதுக்கப்பட்ட எளிய மக்களைக் குறிக்கக் காக்கை குறியீடாகிறது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In modern progressive poetry, what do the marginalized 'Crow' and its black feathers frequently symbolize?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Plutocratic elites", "B": "Marginalized working-class masses and neglected outcasts", "C": "Corrupt ministers", "D": "Monarchs"}, "explanation": "The neglected crow symbolizes marginalized subaltern working people."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 89, "chapter": nu