{"id": "11th_tamil_u7_q175", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "pyq_unit7", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "pyq_bharathidasan_title", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "[TNPSC அசல் வினா] கனக சுப்புரத்தினத்திற்கு 'பாரதிதாசன்' என்ற பெயரும், அவரது பில்கணீயத் தழுவல் நூலால் 'புரட்சிக்கவிஞர்' என்ற பட்டமும் யாரால் எப்போது வழங்கப்பட்டது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "காந்தியடிகளால்", "B": "திரு. வி. க-வால்", "C": "தந்தை பெரியார் மற்றும் அறிஞர் அண்ணாவால் (1946-ல் பொன்முடிப்பு வழங்கி)", "D": "ராஜாஜியால்"}, "explanation": "1946-ல் அறிஞர் அண்ணா, பெரியார் உள்ளிட்டோர் பாரதிதாசனுக்குத் தலைசிறந்த கவிஞராகப் பாராட்டிப் பொற்கிழி (ரூ. 25,000) வழங்கிப் 'புரட்சிக் கவிஞர்' எனச் சிறப்பித்தனர்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "[TNPSC PYQ] By whom was the historic honorific purse and title 'Puratchik Kavignar' conferred upon Bharathidasan in 1946?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Mahatma Gandhi", "B": "Thiru. Vi. Ka.", "C": "Periyar E. V. R. and Arignar Anna (presenting gold purse in 1946)", "D": "Rajaji"}, "explanation": "Periyar and Anna felicitated Bharathidasan with 25,000 gold rupees and the title Puratchi Kavignar."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 148, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit 7, Page 148", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 11", "Unit 7", "PYQ", "Bharathidasan"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "11th_tamil_u7_q176", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "pyq_unit7", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "pyq_pathitrupathu_chera_kings", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "[TNPSC அசல் வினா] பதிற்றுப்பத்தில் இரண்டாம் பத்து இமயவரம்பன் நெடுஞ்சேரலாதனைப் பாடியவர் குமட்டூர்க் கண்ணனார். அப்பாடலுக்குப் பரிசாக மன்னன் குமட்டூர்க் கண்ணனாருக்கு வழங்கியது எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "ஆயிரம் பொற்காசுகள்", "B": "ஒரு யானைப்படை", "C": "தங்கக் கிரீடம்", "D": "உம்பற்காட்டு ஐந்நூறு ஊர்களும், தென்னாட்டு வருவாயுள் முப்பத்தெட்டாண்டுகளுக்குப் பாகமும்"}, "explanation": "பதிற்றுப்பத்துப் பதிகத்தின்படி குமட்டூர்க் கண்ணனாருக்கு உம்பற்காட்டு 500 ஊர்களையும் தென்னாட்டு வருவாயில் 38 ஆண்டுப் பங்கையும் மன்னன் நெடுஞ்சேரலாதன் பரிசாக வழங்கினான்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "[TNPSC PYQ] What unprecedented royal bounty did King Neduncheralathan confer upon poet Kumattur Kannanar for composing the 2nd Decade of Pathitrupathu?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "One thousand gold sovereigns", "B": "An elephant brigade", "C": "Golden crown", "D": "Five hundred villages in Umbarkkadu and a share of southern realm revenues for 38 years"}, "explanation": "Kannanar received 500 villages in Umbarkkadu and revenue rights for 38 years."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 153, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit 7, Page 153", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 11", "Unit 7", "PYQ", "Pathitrupathu"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "11th_tamil_u7_q177", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "pyq_unit7", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "pyq_tamil_theatre_trio", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "[TNPSC அசல் வினா] 'தமிழ் நாடகத் தந்தை' என்று போற்றப்படும் சான்றோர் யார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "பம்மல் சம்பந்த முதலியார்", "B": "சங்கரதாஸ் சுவாமிகள்", "C": "பரிதிமாற்கலைஞர்", "D": "மனோன்மணீயம் சுந்தரனார்"}, "explanation": "'தமிழ் நாடகத் தந்தை' எனப் பம்மல் சம்பந்த முதலியாரும், 'தமிழ் நாடகத் தலைமை ஆசிரியர்' எனச் சங்கரதாஸ் சுவாமிகளும் போற்றப்படுகின்றனர்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "[TNPSC PYQ] Who is universally hailed as the 'Father of Modern Tamil Theatre' (Tamil Nadaga Thanthai)?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Pammal Sambandha Mudaliar", "B": "Sankaradas Swamigal", "C": "Parithimaar Kalaignar", "D": "Manonmaniam Sundaranar"}, "explanation": "Pammal Sambandha Mudaliar is the Father of Modern Tamil Theatre."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 158, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit 7, Page 158", "url": nu