{"id": "11th_tamil_rev1_q046", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "revision_megapack_1", "lesson_id": "rev_u1_u2_supp_grammar", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "punarchi_udalmel_uyirvanthu", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"உடல்மேல் உயிர்வந்து ஒன்றுவது இயல்பே\" என்ற நன்னூல் விதியின்படி புணரும் சொல்லுக்குச் சிறந்த சான்று எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "வாழை + மரம் = வாழைமரம்", "B": "சுடர் + ஆழி = சுடராழி (ர் + ஆ = ரா)", "C": "மண் + குடம் = மட்குடம்", "D": "கல் + சிலை = கற்சிலை"}, "explanation": "நிலைமொழி ஈற்று மெய்யெழுத்தின் மீது (உடல்) வருமொழி முதல் உயிர் வந்து சேர்வது இயல்பான புணர்ச்சியாகும் (சுடர் + ஆழி = சுடராழி)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which sandhi compound exemplifies the classical rule 'Udalmael Uyirvanthu Ondruvathu Iyalbae'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Vaazhai + maram = Vaazhaimaram", "B": "Sudar + aazhi = Sudaraazhi (r + aa = raa)", "C": "Man + kudam = Matkudam", "D": "Kal + silai = Kattrsilai"}, "explanation": "Sudar + aazhi = Sudaraazhi illustrates the direct fusion of a consonant body with an incoming vowel."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_