{"id": "11th_tamil_rev1_q129", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "revision_megapack_1", "lesson_id": "rev_u3_u4_supp_grammar", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "vadivasal_bull_horn_cloth", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'வாடிவாசல்' குறுநாவலில் ஜல்லிக்கட்டுக் காளையின் கொம்பில் வீரப்பரிசாகக் கட்டப்பட்டிருக்கும் துணி எவ்வாறு அழைக்கப்படுகிறது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "உருமுப்பொதி (காசு முடிப்பு / பொற்காசு கட்டிய துணி)", "B": "பட்டுச்சேலை", "C": "வெள்ளைத் துண்டு", "D": "கயிறு"}, "explanation": "காளையின் கொம்பில் கட்டப்பட்டிருக்கும் உருமுப்பொதியை (பண முடிச்சை) எடுப்பவனே காளையை அடக்கிய வீரனாக அறிவிக்கப்படுவான்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In the novella Vaadivaasal, what is the prize purse tied to the horns of the fierce bull called?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Urumuppothi (the prize coin-cloth packet)", "B": "Silk sari", "C": "White towel", "D": "Hemp rope"}, "explanation": "'Urumuppothi' designates the prize purse tied between the horns of the bull."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 65, "chapter": null, "section": null,