{"id": "11th_tamil_rev1_q133", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "revision_megapack_1", "lesson_id": "rev_u3_u4_supp_grammar", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "pagupatham_vanthaan", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'வந்தான்' என்னும் சொல்லில் இடம்பெற்றுள்ள விகாரங்கள் (Morphological mutations) எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "வா என்பது 'வ' எனக் குறுகியது விகாரம்; த் என்பது 'ந்' எனத் திரிந்தது விகாரம்", "B": "ஆன் என்பது அன் ஆனது", "C": "காலம் மாறியது", "D": "விகுதி கெட்டது"}, "explanation": "'வந்தான்' = வா(வ) + த்(ந்) + த் + ஆன். இதில் பகுதி 'வா' குறுகியதும் (வ), சந்தி 'த்' மெலிந்ததும் (ந்) ஆகிய இரண்டு விகாரங்கள் இடம்பெற்றுள்ளன."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What two morphological mutations (Vikarams) occur within the dissection of 'Vanthaan' (He came)?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Root Vaa shortening to Va, and junction plosive th mutating to nasal n (th to n)", "B": "Suffix aan becoming an", "C": "Tense shift", "D": "Suffix elision"}, "explanation": "Both the root shortening (vaa to va) and the junction nasalization (th to n) are classical vikarams."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 73, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit revision_megapack_1, Page 73", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 11", "Revision 1", "Grammar", "Pagupatham"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "11th_tamil_rev1_q134", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "revision_megapack_1", "lesson_id": "rev_u3_u4_supp_grammar", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "thirukkural_yaakaavaaraayinum", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"யாகாவா ராயினும் நாகாக்க காவாக்கால்\nசோகாப்பர் சொல்லிழுக் கப் பட்டு\" - இக்குறட்பா வலியுறுத்தும் இன்றியமையாத அடக்கம் எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "உடல் அடக்கம்", "B": "நாவடக்கம் (பேச்சில் நிதானம்)", "C": "பார்வை அடக்கம்", "D": "செவி அடக்கம்"}, "explanation": "எவற்றைக் காக்க முடியாவிட்டாலும் நாவையாவது அடக்கிக் காக்க வேண்டும்; அவ்வாறு காக்காவிடில் சொற்குற்றத்தில் சிக்கித் துன்புறுவர்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which cardinal discipline of restraint is emphasized in 'Yaakaavaa Raayinum Naagaakka Kaavaakkaal Sogaappar Sollizhukkap Pattu'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Physical bodily restraint", "B": "Restraint of the tongue (Verbal prudence)", "C": "Restraint of gaze", "D": "Restraint of hearing"}, "explanation": "Valluvar urges that whatever else one fails to restrain, one must bridle one's tongue."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 78, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit revision_megapack_1, Page 78", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 11", "Revision 1", "Thirukkural", "Adakkam"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "11th_tamil_rev1_q135", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "revision_megapack_1", "lesson_id": "rev_u3_u4_supp_grammar", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "chellappa_literary_generation", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "எழுத்தாளர் சி. சு. செல்லப்பா எந்த வரலாற்று இலக்கியக் குழுவைச் சார்ந்த முன்னோடி எழுத்தாளராவார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "வானம்பாடி இயக்கம்", "B": "மறுமலர்ச்சி எழுத்தாளர் சங்கம்", "C": "மணிக்கொடி எழுத்தாளர் தலைமுறை", "D": "முற்போக்கு எழுத்தாளர் சங்கம்"}, "explanation": "சி. சு. செல்லப்பா 1930-களில் தமிழ் உரைநடை இலக்கியத்தை நவீனப்படுத்திய 'மணிக்கொடி' எழுத்தாளர் தலைமுறையைச் சேர்ந்த முதன்மையான படைப்பாளியாவார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "To which historic literary vanguard generation did writer C. S. Chellappa belong?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Vaanambaadi movement", "B": "Renaissance Writers Union", "C": "The Manikkodi literary generation", "D": "Progressive Writers Association"}, "explanation": "C. S. Chellappa was an illustrious luminary of the legendary Manikkodi generation."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 64, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit revision_megapack_1, Page 64", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 11", "Revision 1", "Supplementary", "Chellappa"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "11th_tamil_rev1_q136", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "easy", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "revision_megapack_1", "lesson_id": "rev_u3_u4_supp_grammar", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "viyangol_suffixes_list", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "இலக்கணம்: வாழ்த்துதல், வைதல், வேண்டல், விதித்தல் ஆகிய பொருள்களில் வரும் 'வியங்கோள் வினைமுற்று விகுதிகள்' எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "-அன், -ஆன்", "B": "-அள், -ஆள்", "C": "-து, -று", "D": "-க, -ய, -இய, -இயர் (எ.கா: வாழ்க, வாழிய, வாழியர்)"}, "explanation": "வியங்கோள் வினைமுற்று விகுதிகளாகக் 'க, ய, இய, இயர்' ஆகியவை அமைகின்றன (வாழ்க, வாழி, வாழிய, வாழியர்)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Grammar: Which suffixes characterize the optative finite verb (Viyangol Vinaimutru) expressing benediction, mandate, or wish?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "-an, -aan", "B": "-all, -aall", "C": "-thu, -tru", "D": "-ka, -ya, -iya, -iyar (e.g., Vaazhga, Vaazhiya, Vaazhiyar)"}, "explanation": "Optative suffixes in classical Tamil are -ka, -ya, -iya, and -iyar."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 73, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit revision_megapack_1, Page 73", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 11", "Revision 1", "Grammar", "Pagupatham"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "11th_tamil_rev1_q137", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "revision_megapack_1", "lesson_id": "rev_u3_u4_supp_grammar", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "thirukkural_ozhukkathin_eythuvar", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"ஒழுக்கத்தின் எய்துவர் மேன்மை இழுக்கத்தின்\nஎய்துவர் எய்தாப் பழி\" - இக்குறட்பா உணர்த்தும் இருவேறு விளைவுகள் எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "நல்லொழுக்கத்தால் மனிதன் மேன்மையை அடைவான்; ஒழுக்கம் தவறுவதால் தீராத பெரும் பழியை அடைவான்", "B": "செல்வமும் வறுமையும்", "C": "வெற்றியும் தோல்வியும்", "D": "இளமையும் முதுமையும்"}, "explanation": "நல்லொழுக்கம் ஒருவனுக்கு அழியாத நன்மதிப்பையும் மேன்மையையும் பெற்றுத்தரும்; ஒழுக்கக் கேடு தீராத பழியையும் அவமானத்தையும் தரும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What twin contrasting consequences are delineated in 'Ozhukkathin Eythuvar Maenmai Izhukkathin Eythuvar Eithaap Pazhi'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Righteous conduct yields exalted dignity, whereas moral transgression incurs indelible infamy", "B": "Wealth and poverty", "C": "Victory and defeat", "D": "Youth and old age"}, "explanation": "Righteousness secures elevated dignity while lapse in conduct attracts permanent disgrace."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 78, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit revision_megapack_1, Page 78", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 11", "Revision 1", "Thirukkural", "Ozhukkam"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "11th_tamil_rev1_q138", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "revision_megapack_1", "lesson_id": "rev_u3_u4_supp_grammar", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "thozhirpeyar_suffixes_list", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "இலக்கணம்: தொழிற்பெயரை (Verbal Noun) உருவாக்கும் விகுதிகளின் சரியான வரிசை எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "-ஆன், -ஆள், -ஆர்", "B": "-தல், -அல், -ஐ, -கை, -மை, -சி, -பு (எ.கா: செய்தல், ஆட்டம், பார்வை)", "C": "-க, -இய", "D": "-உ, -இ"}, "explanation": "செய்தல் (-தல்), ஆடல் (-அல்), வாழ்க்கை (-கை), நடத்தை (-ஐ) போன்ற தொழிற்பெயர்களை உருவாக்கும் விகுதிகளாக இவை விளங்குகின்றன."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Grammar: Which group accurately lists the verbal nominalizing suffixes (Thozhirpeyar Vikuthi)?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "-aan, -aall, -aar", "B": "-thal, -al, -ai, -kai, -mai, -si, -pu (e.g., Seithal, Aadal, Paarvai)", "C": "-ka, -iya", "D": "-u, -i"}, "explanation": "-thal, -al, -ai, -kai, and -mai are cardinal nominalizing formatives."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 73, "chapter": null, "section": null, "re