{"id": "11th_tamil_rev2_q040", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "revision_megapack_2", "lesson_id": "rev_u5_u6_modern_grammar", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "performing_artists_matching", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "இசை மற்றும் நடன மேதைகளையும் அவர்கள் பெற்ற சிறப்புகளையும் பொருத்துக:\n(a) எம். எஸ். சுப்புலட்சுமி - 1. முதல் பெண் வித்துவான் / தேசபக்திப் பாடகர்\n(b) டி. கே. பட்டம்மாள் - 2. பாரத ரத்னா பெற்ற முதல் இசைக் கலைஞர்\n(c) பாலசரஸ்வதி - 3. பத்மஸ்ரீ பெற்ற முதல் திருநங்கை நடனக் கலைஞர் (2019)\n(d) நர்த்தகி நடராஜ் - 4. அகில உலகப் புகழ்பெற்ற பரதநாட்டியக் கலைஞர்", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "a-1, b-2, c-3, d-4", "B": "a-4, b-3, c-2, d-1", "C": "a-3, b-4, c-1, d-2", "D": "a-2, b-1, c-4, d-3"}, "explanation": "எம். எஸ். சுப்புலட்சுமி (பாரத ரத்னா-2), டி. கே. பட்டம்மாள் (தேசபக்தி-1), பாலசரஸ்வதி (உலகப் புகழ்பெற்ற பரதநாட்டியம்-4), நர்த்தகி நடராஜ் (பத்மஸ்ரீ 2019-3)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the classical performing artists with their distinction:\n(a) M. S. Subbulakshmi - 1. Patriotic singer / Carnatic stalwart\n(b) D. K. Pattammal - 2. First musician awarded Bharat Ratna\n(c) Balasaraswati - 3. First trans Bharatanatyam dancer awarded Padma Shri\n(d) Narthaki Nataraj - 4. Internationally acclaimed Bharatanatyam legend", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "a-1, b-2, c-3, d-4", "B": "a-4, b-3, c-2, d-1", "C": "a-3, b-4, c-1, d-2", "D": "a-2, b-1, c-4, d-3"}, "explanation": "M. S. Subbulakshmi (Bharat Ratna-2), D. K. Pattammal (Patriotic music-1), Balasaraswati (Global Bharatanatyam icon-4), Narthaki Nataraj (Padma Shri 2019-3)."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 138, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit revision_megapack_2, Page 138", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 11", "Revision 2", "Artists", "Honours"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "11th_tamil_rev2_q041", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "revision_megapack_2", "lesson_id": "rev_u5_u6_modern_grammar", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "thisaippeyar_vallinam", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘திசைப்பெயர்களின் பின் வல்லினம் மிகும்’ - என்பதற்குப் பொருத்தமான எடுத்துக்காட்டு எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "கிழக்குக் கடற்கரை, வடக்குத் தெரு", "B": "வடக்கு நாடு, மேற்கு மலை", "C": "தெற்கு வாசல், கிழக்கு திசை", "D": "மேற்கு காற்று, வடக்கு காற்று"}, "explanation": "கிழக்கு, மேற்கு, தெற்கு, வடக்கு என்னும் திசைப்பெயர்களின் பின் வரும் வல்லினம் கண்டிப்பாக மிகும் (கிழக்கு + கடற்கரை = கிழக்குக் கடற்கரை; வடக்கு + தெரு = வடக்குத் தெரு)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which is a correct example for the rule 'Vallinam doubles after cardinal directional nouns'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Kizhakuk kadarkarai, Vadakuth theru", "B": "Vadakku naadu, Merku malai", "C": "Therku vaasal, Kizhakku thisai", "D": "Merku kaatru, Vadakku kaatru"}, "explanation": "Directional nouns ending in hard vowels consistently double initial k, s, th, p consonants."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 141, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit revision_megapack_2, Page 141", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 11", "Revision 2", "Directional Nouns", "Grammar"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "11th_tamil_rev2_q042", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "revision_megapack_2", "lesson_id": "rev_u5_u6_modern_grammar", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "pichamurthi_career", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "ந. பிச்சமூர்த்தி வழக்கறிஞராகவும் பின்னர் எந்தத் துறையில் அலுவலராகவும் பணியாற்றினார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "வனத்துறை", "B": "இந்து சமய அறநிலையத்துறை (கோயில் நிர்வாக அலுவலர்)", "C": "வருவாய்த்துறை", "D": "கல்வித்துறை"}, "explanation": "ந. பிச்சமூர்த்தி வழக்கறிஞராகப் பணியாற்றிய பின் இந்து சமய அறநிலையத்துறையில் செயல் அலுவலராக (Executive Officer) பணியாற்றினார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In addition to practicing law, in which department did Na. Pichamurthi serve as an officer?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Forest Department", "B": "Hindu Religious and Charitable Endowments (HR&CE temple executive officer)", "C": "Revenue Department", "D": "Education Department"}, "explanation": "Na. Pichamurthi practiced law before serving as an Executive Officer in the Hindu Religious Endowments Department."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "