{"id": "11th_tamil_rev2_q145", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "revision_megapack_2", "lesson_id": "rev_u5_u8_grammar_mega_test", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "marabuthodar_matching", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "மரபுத்தொடர்களையும் அவற்றின் உண்மைப் பொருளையும் பொருத்துக:\n(a) கானல் நீர் - 1. இல்லாத ஒன்று / பொய்\n(b) கிணற்றுத் தவளை - 2. வெளி உலகம் அறியாத அறியாமை\n(c) ஆகாயத் தாமரை - 3. ஒருபோதும் முடியாத கற்பனை\n(d) முதலைக் கண்ணீர் - 4. போலியான இரக்கம்", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "a-1, b-2, c-3, d-4", "B": "a-2, b-1, c-4, d-3", "C": "a-3, b-4, c-1, d-2", "D": "a-4, b-3, c-2, d-1"}, "explanation": "கானல் நீர் (பொய்த் தோற்றம்), கிணற்றுத் தவளை (அறியாமை), ஆகாயத் தாமரை (நடைமுறை சாத்தியமற்றது), முதலைக் கண்ணீர் (போலி இரக்கம்). நேர் பொருத்தம் a-1, b-2, c-3, d-4."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match Tamil idiomatic expressions (Marabuthodar) with their precise definitions:\n(a) Kaanal Neer - 1. Mirage / illusion\n(b) Kinattru Thavalai - 2. Frog in a well (sheltered ignorance)\n(c) Aagaya Thamarai - 3. Impossible fantasy\n(d) Muthalai Kanneer - 4. Crocodile tears (feigned grief)", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "a-1, b-2, c-3, d-4", "B": "a-2, b-1, c-4, d-3", "C": "a-3, b-4, c-1, d-2", "D": "a-4, b-3, c-2, d-1"}, "explanation": "Classic Tamil idioms matched directly with their conceptual metaphorical meanings."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 218, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit revision_megapack_2, Page 218", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 11", "Revision 2", "Idioms", "Semantics"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "11th_tamil_rev2_q146", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "grammar_identification", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "revision_megapack_2", "lesson_id": "rev_u5_u8_grammar_mega_test", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "vallinam_migum_check", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பின்வரும் தொடர்களுள் வல்லினம் மிக வேண்டிய இடத்தில் மிகாமல் வந்துள்ள பிழையான தொடர் எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "செம்பவளம்", "B": "கடைக்கு சென்றான்", "C": "மண்பாண்டம்", "D": "பொன்வண்டு"}, "explanation": "‘கடைக்கு’ என்பது நான்காம் வேற்றுமை உருபு (கு) வெளிப்பட்டு வந்த தொடர். நான்காம் வேற்றுமை விரியின் பின் வல்லினம் மிக வேண்டும். 'கடைக்குச் சென்றான்' என்றே எழுத வேண்டும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Identify the phrase that incorrectly OMITS required sandhi doubling:", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Sempavazham", "B": "Kadaikku sentraan", "C": "Manpaandam", "D": "Ponvandu"}, "explanation": "'Kadaikku' carries the overt 4th case marker '-ku' which mandatorily demands doubling ('Kadaikku-ch chentraan')."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 141, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Uni