{"id": "12th_tamil_u2_q320", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_2", "lesson_id": "naalvagai_poruthangal", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "thinai_vazhuvamaidhi_example", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘என் லட்சுமி வந்தாள்’ என்று மாட்டைக் குறிப்பிடுவது எவ்வகை வழுவமைதி?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "பால் வழுவமைதி", "B": "இட வழுவமைதி", "C": "கால வழுவமைதி", "D": "திணை வழுவமைதி (உவப்பின் காரணமாக அஃறிணையை உயர்திணையாகக் கூறுதல்)"}, "explanation": "பசு மாடு அஃறிணை; ஆயினும் அதன்பால் கொண்ட அளவிலா அன்பின் (உவப்பின்) காரணமாக ‘வந்தாள்’ என உயர்திணையாகக் கூறியதால் ‘திணை வழுவமைதி’ ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Referring to a domestic cow affectionately as 'My Lakshmi has arrived' (Lakshmi vandhaal) is an example of what?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Paal Vazhuvamaidhi", "B": "Ida Vazhuvamaidhi", "C": "Kaala Vazhuvamaidhi", "D": "Thinai Vazhuvamaidhi (elevating Ahri-nai to Uyar-thinai out of intense affection)"}, "explanation": "Addressing an animal with a human feminine verb out of endearment is Thinai Vazhuvamaidhi."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "editi