{"id": "12th_tamil_mp1_q1671", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_1", "lesson_id": "synoptic_mock_4", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "porul_mayakkam_comma", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "நிறுத்தற்குறிகளை (காற்புள்ளி) தவறான இடத்தில் இடுவதால் பொருள் எவ்வாறு மாறுகிறது?\n(1) ‘அவனைப் பிடிக்காதே, விடு’ \n(2) ‘அவனைப் பிடிக்காதே விடு’ / ‘அவனைப் பிடி, காதே விடு’", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "பொருளில் எந்த மாற்றமும் ஏற்படாது", "B": "இரண்டும் அவனைப் பிடிக்குமாறு மட்டுமே கூறும்", "C": "காற்புள்ளி இடம் மாறும்போது, ஒரு தொடர் அவனை விடுவிக்கச் சொல்லும் பொருளையும், மற்றொன்று அவனைக் காது வரை இழுத்துப் பிடிக்குமாறு விபரீதப் பொருளையும் தரும்", "D": "இரண்டும் அவனை அடிக்கச் சொல்லும்"}, "explanation": "காற்புள்ளி மாறும் போது வாக்கியத்தின் பொருளையே தலைகீழாக மாற்றிவிடும் என்பதற்கு இத்தொடர் செவ்வியல் சான்றாகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "How does the misplacement of a comma completely invert the meaning in Tamil sentences?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Has no semantic impact whatsoever", "B": "Both sentences merely direct seizing him", "C": "Punctuation shift alters the mandate: one directs releasing him safely, while the other commands clutching him violently by the ears", "D": "Both direct thrashing him"}, "explanation": "A displaced comma can alter an instruction from releasing a prisoner to violently seizing him."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 67, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit megapack_1, Page 67", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "MegaPack 1", "Mock 4", "Punctuation Flaws"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_mp1_q1672", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "easy", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_1", "lesson_id": "synoptic_mock_4", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "thirukkural_kodai_arvalam", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘வறியார்க்கொன்று ஈவதே ஈகை மற்றெல்லாம் குறியெதிர்ப்பை நீர துடைத்து’ - இக்குறள் உணர்த்தும் ஈகை இலக்கணம் யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "செல்வந்தர்களுக்குப் பரிசு தருவது", "B": "கைம்மாறு எதிர்பார்த்துக் கொடுப்பது", "C": "வட்டிக்குக் கடன் கொடுப்பது", "D": "இல்லாத ஏழை எளியவர்க்குக் கொடுப்பதே உண்மையான ஈகை; மற்றதெல்லாம் கைம்மாறு கருதிச் செய்யும் வணிகமே ஆகும்"}, "explanation": "வறியவருக்குக் கொடுப்பதே தூய ஈகை; பிறருக்குப் பிரதிபலன் எதிர்பார்த்துக் கொடுப்பது கடன் கொடுத்தலைப் போன்றதே ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What is the authentic definition of charity according to Kural: 'Variyaarkkontru eevadhe eegai matrellam kuriyethirppai neera thudaiththu'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Offering gifts to wealthy dignitaries", "B": "Giving with calculated expectation of reciprocal return", "C": "Lending money on compound interest", "D": "Bestowing upon the destitute who have nothing is true charity; all other giving is merely a transactional trade of reciprocal barter"}, "explanation": "True charity is giving solely to the destitute; all else is mere transactional exchange expecting future payback."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 64, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit megapack_1, Page 64", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "MegaPack 1", "Mock 4", "Charity Definition"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_mp1_q1673", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_1", "lesson_id": "synoptic_mock_4", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "avvaiyar_moral_courage", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "ஔவையாரின் தூது உரையில் வெளிப்படும் தலையாய பண்பு எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "அஞ்சாமை, வாய்மை, நடுவுநிலைமை மற்றும் மாசற்ற புலமைத் துணிவு", "B": "அரசனைப் போற்றிப் புகழ்ந்து பிழைப்பது", "C": "பகை மன்னனை ஏமாற்றுதல்", "D": "தற்பெருமை பேசுதல்"}, "explanation": "ஔவையார் எத்தகைய கொடிய மன்னனின் முன்பும் அஞ்சாமல் உண்மையை எடுத்துரைக்கும் பெரும் புலமைத் துணிவும் அறநெறியும் கொண்டவர்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What paramount moral trait distinguishes Avvaiyar's fearless diplomatic discourse before King Thondaiman?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Fearless moral fortitude, unflinching truth, upright impartiality, and uncompromising poetic integrity", "B": "Obsequious sycophancy to flatter sovereigns for survival", "C": "Treacherous deception of enemy rulers", "D": "Vainglorious boastfulness"}, "explanation": "Avvaiyar epitomized fearless moral integrity and diplomatic candor before absolute power."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 87, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit megapack_1, Page 87", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "MegaPack 1", "Mock 4", "Avvaiyar Character"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_mp1_q1674", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_1", "lesson_id": "synoptic_mock_4", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "u_ve_sa_manuscript_hunting_method", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "உ.வே. சாமிநாதையர் பழைய ஓலைச்சுவடிகளைத் தேடிச் சென்ற இடங்களில் எதிர்கொண்ட பெரும் சவால்கள் எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "வெளிநாட்டுப் பல்கலைக்கழகங்களின் எதிர்ப்பு", "B": "ஆற்று வெள்ளத்தில் ஏடுகள் வீசப்படுதல், பூச்சிகளால் அரிக்கப்படுதல், தீயிலிட்டு எரிக்கப்படுதல் மற்றும் ஏடுகளின் உரிமையாளர்களின் அறியாமை", "C": "பொருளாதாரப் போட்டி", "D": "அரசுத் தடை உத்தரவு"}, "explanation": "ஆடிப் பெருக்கு அன்று ஆற்றில் விடுதல், கொள்ளி வைத்தல் முதலான அறியாமையால் அழிந்த பழந்தமிழ் ஏடுகளை உ.வே.சா பெரும் துன்பங்களுக்கு இடையே மீட்டார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What harrowing obstacles did U.V. Swaminatha Iyer encounter during his expeditions to recover palm-leaf manuscripts?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Hostility from Western universities", "B": "Manuscripts being cast into river floods during seasonal rituals, consumed by termites, burnt as firewood, and owners' superstitious ignorance", "C": "Corporate market competition", "D": "Statutory state prohibition decrees"}, "explanation": "He raced against ignorance and seasonal rituals where priceless classical manuscripts were consigned to flames and rivers."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 75, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit megapack_1, Page 75", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "MegaPack 1", "Mock 4", "Manuscript Preservation"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_mp1_q1675", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_1", "lesson_id": "synoptic_mock_4", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "speed_limits_traffic", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பள்ளி மற்றும் மருத்துவமனை வளாகங்களின் அருகே வாகனங்கள் செல்ல அனுமதிக்கப்பட்டுள்ள உச்ச வேகம் என்ன?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "மணிக்கு 60 கி.மீ", "B": "மணிக்கு 45 கி.மீ", "C": "மணிக்கு 25 முதல் 30 கி.மீ வரை", "D": "மணிக்கு 80 கி.மீ"}, "explanation": "பள்ளிகள், மருத்துவமனைகள் அமைந்துள்ள பகுதிகளில் மாணவர்கள் மற்றும் நோயாளிகளின் பாதுகாப்பிற்காக 25-30 கி.மீ மட்டுமே வேகம் அனுமதிக்கப்படுகிறது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What is the permissible statutory speed limit for motor vehicles adjacent to school zones and hospital premises?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "60 km/h", "B": "45 km/h", "C": "25 to 30 km/h (Slow speed zone)", "D": "80 km/h"}, "explanation": "School and hospital safety buffer zones mandate restricted speeds of 25 to 30 km/h."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 92, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Ta